(541647, 54509, 1717, '<td valign="top">ROFL!!!  what a hoot!  the arms look so little.  perfect DOF and lighting...great job!</td>', 'ROFL!!!  what a hoot!  the arms look so little.  perfect DOF and lighting...great job!', '2004-01-14 00:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(541654, 54922, 14001, '<td valign="top">This is by far the best pic in the challenge looking up a tree.  Very original.  The others must have copied you.  Perfect composition.</td>', 'This is by far the best pic in the challenge looking up a tree.  Very original.  The others must have copied you.  Perfect composition.', '2004-01-14 00:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(541655, 55078, 1717, '<td valign="top">lolol...what a great capture!  the lighting is awesome as are the colors.  good work!</td>', 'lolol...what a great capture!  the lighting is awesome as are the colors.  good work!', '2004-01-14 00:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(541659, 54478, 15032, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I would have liked to have seen a faster shutter speed.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I would have liked to have seen a faster shutter speed.', '2004-01-14 00:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(541660, 55126, 13390, '<td valign="top">Really neat idea, but I am not exactly sure what I am looking at, iow: There is no real focus or subject in the shot. I really enjoy the blur effect, most people will most likely complain, but honestly, I think it adds a nice effect.</td>', 'Really neat idea, but I am not exactly sure what I am looking at, iow: There is no real focus or subject in the shot. I really enjoy the blur effect, most people will most likely complain, but honestly, I think it adds a nice effect.', '2004-01-14 00:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(541661, 55118, 15032, '<td valign="top">Personally, I would have chosen the strings in the foreground of the picture to be in focus and the rest of the guitar blurred. But I like it</td>', 'Personally, I would have chosen the strings in the foreground of the picture to be in focus and the rest of the guitar blurred. But I like it', '2004-01-14 00:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(541662, 55068, 15968, '<td valign="top">lovely texture</td>', 'lovely texture', '2004-01-14 00:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(541663, 54751, 15032, '<td valign="top">I like the pixilated effect! Great picture.</td>', 'I like the pixilated effect! Great picture.', '2004-01-14 00:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(541666, 54532, 13390, '<td valign="top">A very enjoyable picture to look at; I love the BW treatment, absolutely gorgeous! The only thing I would fix is centering the image to stress the symmetry, especially when you are using a title such as Geometry, which correlates to mathematics and symmetry, other than that small blip, a very nice shot that fits the challenge well.</td>', 'A very enjoyable picture to look at; I love the BW treatment, absolutely gorgeous! The only thing I would fix is centering the image to stress the symmetry, especially when you are using a title such as Geometry, which correlates to mathematics and symmetry, other than that small blip, a very nice shot that fits the challenge well.', '2004-01-14 00:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(541668, 54761, 15968, '<td valign="top">an excellent photo!!  to my eye there is a lovely balance created by the chain and the bridge... they are the same.  Lovely!</td>', 'an excellent photo!!  to my eye there is a lovely balance created by the chain and the bridge... they are the same.  Lovely!', '2004-01-14 00:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
