(541892, 54368, 5728, '<td valign="top">"Loneliness" (Sorry it''s the English teacher coming out of me :)<br/> <br/>A very serene and well composed photo. I can almost hear the silence here. It comes over a little on the flat side for some reason however, somehow the saturation isn''t coming through as much as I would like. (8)</td>', '"Loneliness" (Sorry it''s the English teacher coming out of me :) A very serene and well composed photo. I can almost hear the silence here. It comes over a little on the flat side for some reason however, somehow the saturation isn''t coming through as much as I would like. (8)', '2004-01-14 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(541893, 55006, 6130, '<td valign="top">Unusual and good.</td>', 'Unusual and good.', '2004-01-14 02:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(541894, 54691, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting landscape. What are those holes there, is that some kind of quarry? I do like this image, especially with the highway being a leading line into your pic. What is that airstrip kind of thing running in towards that hole?</td>', 'Interesting landscape. What are those holes there, is that some kind of quarry? I do like this image, especially with the highway being a leading line into your pic. What is that airstrip kind of thing running in towards that hole?', '2004-01-14 02:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(541895, 54356, 5728, '<td valign="top">This just has to be English with those chimney stacks!! Pity the sky is overcast, a crispy blue sky would have brought in excellent contrast against the greens and reds on the houses. This is still good though, just unfortunate about the skies.</td>', 'This just has to be English with those chimney stacks!! Pity the sky is overcast, a crispy blue sky would have brought in excellent contrast against the greens and reds on the houses. This is still good though, just unfortunate about the skies.', '2004-01-14 02:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(541896, 55076, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very good image, a pleasure to look at and well set up. The lighting is also almost spot on except for some harsh spots on the second flower from the top and the two bottom white ones. (9)</td>', 'Very good image, a pleasure to look at and well set up. The lighting is also almost spot on except for some harsh spots on the second flower from the top and the two bottom white ones. (9)', '2004-01-14 02:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
