(541899, 54920, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hi mom :) Nice countryside! Some traces of artefacting around the top of the hills, and I would probably have composed the image without centering your main subject so much.</td>', 'Hi mom :) Nice countryside! Some traces of artefacting around the top of the hills, and I would probably have composed the image without centering your main subject so much.', '2004-01-14 03:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(541900, 55080, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-01-14 03:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(541910, 54930, 11321, '<td valign="top">:D<br/>It is sure a rare point of view for some diehard fans who always sit close to the teems :p</td>', ':DIt is sure a rare point of view for some diehard fans who always sit close to the teems :p', '2004-01-14 03:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(541913, 54333, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very convincing winter color tones, The blues and whites bring through the feeling of coldness. The graininess helps a little but I think there is slightly too much in your image. I wish I could see the eye, or at least a glint or something to tell me there is actually an eye there instead of a empty black area. As for the point of view aspect, well there isn''t anything unusual or different in the perspective you have chosen. (7)</td>', 'Very convincing winter color tones, The blues and whites bring through the feeling of coldness. The graininess helps a little but I think there is slightly too much in your image. I wish I could see the eye, or at least a glint or something to tell me there is actually an eye there instead of a empty black area. As for the point of view aspect, well there isn''t anything unusual or different in the perspective you have chosen. (7)', '2004-01-14 04:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(541915, 55080, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful serene photo. The softness of the snow amplifies the silence that this photo expresses. The barely visible mountains in the background hiding in the mist bring in another dimension to your photo. Top lighting, except for the lens flare, which is annoying in my opinion. Not so much the lens flare itself but the position it is in, in the middle of the wire (9)</td>', 'Beautiful serene photo. The softness of the snow amplifies the silence that this photo expresses. The barely visible mountains in the background hiding in the mist bring in another dimension to your photo. Top lighting, except for the lens flare, which is annoying in my opinion. Not so much the lens flare itself but the position it is in, in the middle of the wire (9)', '2004-01-14 04:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(541916, 55117, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea! Lacks a little on saturation in my opinion. Top composition though and the lighting is also spot on (7)</td>', 'Good idea! Lacks a little on saturation in my opinion. Top composition though and the lighting is also spot on (7)', '2004-01-14 04:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(541921, 55005, 5728, '<td valign="top">What a cute kitty. The lighting is good as is the composition and DOF (8)</td>', 'What a cute kitty. The lighting is good as is the composition and DOF (8)', '2004-01-14 04:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
