(541928, 54675, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo. The combination of sharpness and DOF is amazing. The color tones are very friendly and work harmoniously together. Top marks from me (10)</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo. The combination of sharpness and DOF is amazing. The color tones are very friendly and work harmoniously together. Top marks from me (10)', '2004-01-14 04:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(541932, 54761, 11440, '<td valign="top">Like a postcard. I like it!</td>', 'Like a postcard. I like it!', '2004-01-14 04:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(541933, 54859, 11321, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great find!<br/>The houses and cars at the left-up corner are distracting.</td>', 'Wow! Great find!The houses and cars at the left-up corner are distracting.', '2004-01-14 04:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(541934, 54835, 5728, '<td valign="top">I really like this kind of photography, and I could look at photos like this for hours. The girl''s stance and expression looks very natural, not at all acted. The play of light and shadow comes over very effectively, although the sudden shadow below her nose turning the mouth area into a dark empty hole is not how I would have done it myself. It comes over a little strange also giving me the feeling that the top part of her chest is distorted somehow. But still a very classy photo (9)</td>', 'I really like this kind of photography, and I could look at photos like this for hours. The girl''s stance and expression looks very natural, not at all acted. The play of light and shadow comes over very effectively, although the sudden shadow below her nose turning the mouth area into a dark empty hole is not how I would have done it myself. It comes over a little strange also giving me the feeling that the top part of her chest is distorted somehow. But still a very classy photo (9)', '2004-01-14 04:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(541935, 55058, 5728, '<td valign="top">The reflections and perspective work harmoniously together here (8)</td>', 'The reflections and perspective work harmoniously together here (8)', '2004-01-14 04:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
