(541950, 54509, 12802, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, different kind of cat shot here. Nice and clear, good details in the cats eyes.<br/> <br/>I quite like this one, his (her) head looks bigger than I feel it should be, but this adds to the shot.  Is he standing on two legs?  8</td>', 'Hmmm, different kind of cat shot here. Nice and clear, good details in the cats eyes. I quite like this one, his (her) head looks bigger than I feel it should be, but this adds to the shot.  Is he standing on two legs?  8', '2004-01-14 04:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
