(542246, 55031, 1779, '<td valign="top">if i was to rate the idea alone, this would be a 10. congrats! now the photo: it seems like you used flash because the wires are way to bright; also,  in shots like this, try using a wider apperture (+ 5.6) to get the greatest focal distance possible. hope this helps.<br/> <br/>LM</td>', 'if i was to rate the idea alone, this would be a 10. congrats! now the photo: it seems like you used flash because the wires are way to bright; also,  in shots like this, try using a wider apperture (+ 5.6) to get the greatest focal distance possible. hope this helps. LM', '2004-01-14 09:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
