(542349, 54856, 13759, '<td valign="top">Well, I had tryed to get some of this before and will compart my experience. Glasses are so dificult to shot! They reflect many light, you need to improve the light control to remove the undesired, distractive frontal glare of it. Other thing that I learn is that glass are very dificult to mantain clear to shot. You had some smudges and pieces of material (apear to be from clothe) adhered on it. Finally the crop may show the entire glass.</td>', 'Well, I had tryed to get some of this before and will compart my experience. Glasses are so dificult to shot! They reflect many light, you need to improve the light control to remove the undesired, distractive frontal glare of it. Other thing that I learn is that glass are very dificult to mantain clear to shot. You had some smudges and pieces of material (apear to be from clothe) adhered on it. Finally the crop may show the entire glass.', '2004-01-14 10:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(542352, 55125, 327, '<td valign="top">I read the title and then looked at the shot. That story still give me the creeps. lol<br/>Pretty view. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I read the title and then looked at the shot. That story still give me the creeps. lolPretty view. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-01-14 10:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
