(542554, 54617, 12962, '<td valign="top">Ents live in dpchallenge ... beautiful!  There''s not much to say ... composition is great, the colors are good, everything is sharp ... and the challenge point of view theme is met.  Well done!</td>', 'Ents live in dpchallenge ... beautiful!  There''s not much to say ... composition is great, the colors are good, everything is sharp ... and the challenge point of view theme is met.  Well done!', '2004-01-14 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
