(542586, 55026, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. It looks like it was taken on Mars or something, with red sand and stars.</td>', 'Nice effect. It looks like it was taken on Mars or something, with red sand and stars.', '2004-01-14 12:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
