(542591, 55095, 2780, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem like a very creative point of view to me, just straight onto the front of the building.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem like a very creative point of view to me, just straight onto the front of the building.', '2004-01-14 12:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
