(542608, 54289, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. The grain really accentuates the haze and gives this a fantasy look. I''m not sure about the hill on the left. Seems too clear to be part of the picture.</td>', 'Very nice shot. The grain really accentuates the haze and gives this a fantasy look. I''m not sure about the hill on the left. Seems too clear to be part of the picture.', '2004-01-14 12:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
