(542810, 54720, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-01-14 13:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(542812, 55076, 15642, '<td valign="top">Actually, I''d like to see a composition without the stars. The bowls and shadows are pretty cool and seem to fight the stars. Very nice though!</td>', 'Actually, I''d like to see a composition without the stars. The bowls and shadows are pretty cool and seem to fight the stars. Very nice though!', '2004-01-14 13:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(542813, 54860, 15642, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more clarity, but nice moment caught.</td>', 'Needs a bit more clarity, but nice moment caught.', '2004-01-14 13:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542814, 55081, 14614, '<td valign="top">Innovative use of pov.  The fuzzy background is an excellent artisic choice.  Minor nit - something is weird about the hand and draws my attention away from the other effective elements.  Well done, otherwise</td>', 'Innovative use of pov.  The fuzzy background is an excellent artisic choice.  Minor nit - something is weird about the hand and draws my attention away from the other effective elements.  Well done, otherwise', '2004-01-14 13:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(542815, 54720, 15642, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective</td>', 'Neat perspective', '2004-01-14 13:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(542817, 54702, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-01-14 13:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(542819, 54696, 15642, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. A single person would''ve ruined it. The carpet is quite graphic!! Nice!</td>', 'Very interesting. A single person would''ve ruined it. The carpet is quite graphic!! Nice!', '2004-01-14 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(542821, 54724, 15642, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Caged banana!</td>', 'Mmm. Caged banana!', '2004-01-14 13:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(542822, 54715, 15703, '<td valign="top">A very nice, clean simple image.</td>', 'A very nice, clean simple image.', '2004-01-14 13:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(542823, 55128, 14614, '<td valign="top">Innovative pov.  interesting use of dof - while the blurry bull sends the message of motion (a good thing) I would like to see some part of it in focus to make the near-danger impact stronger.</td>', 'Innovative pov.  interesting use of dof - while the blurry bull sends the message of motion (a good thing) I would like to see some part of it in focus to make the near-danger impact stronger.', '2004-01-14 13:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(542824, 54509, 15642, '<td valign="top">We know what comes next...<br/>Nicely shot!</td>', 'We know what comes next...Nicely shot!', '2004-01-14 13:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(542826, 55081, 15642, '<td valign="top">Too literal for me.</td>', 'Too literal for me.', '2004-01-14 13:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(542827, 55132, 11155, '<td valign="top">Excellent POV!  Colors and sharpness are great.  Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent POV!  Colors and sharpness are great.  Good luck.', '2004-01-14 13:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(542833, 54935, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot, 10</td>', 'Great shot, 10', '2004-01-14 13:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(542837, 54513, 15642, '<td valign="top">Incredible clarity! I''ve never seen Toledo look so vibrant!</td>', 'Incredible clarity! I''ve never seen Toledo look so vibrant!', '2004-01-14 13:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(542840, 54454, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2004-01-14 13:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542841, 54506, 2780, '<td valign="top">Lol, this is great, 10</td>', 'Lol, this is great, 10', '2004-01-14 13:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542842, 54371, 15642, '<td valign="top">I''m usually against guitar pics, but nice way to see it.</td>', 'I''m usually against guitar pics, but nice way to see it.', '2004-01-14 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(542843, 55078, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of a great moment!</td>', 'Nice catch of a great moment!', '2004-01-14 13:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(542845, 54674, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice. I love the monochrome feel.</td>', 'Nice. I love the monochrome feel.', '2004-01-14 13:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(542846, 54393, 15703, '<td valign="top">Mmm. I shouldn''t really like this. It seems a bit "snappy" with little planning of the background. But the sunject''s expression, and the very same unplanned background make it a bit reportage-y. So, I like it.</td>', 'Mmm. I shouldn''t really like this. It seems a bit "snappy" with little planning of the background. But the sunject''s expression, and the very same unplanned background make it a bit reportage-y. So, I like it.', '2004-01-14 13:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(542847, 54857, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice job. New spin on the ''kid shot."</td>', 'Nice job. New spin on the ''kid shot."', '2004-01-14 13:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(542848, 55094, 2780, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, but the photo is completly out of focus.</td>', 'Clever idea, but the photo is completly out of focus.', '2004-01-14 13:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542849, 55083, 2780, '<td valign="top">Lol, he looks so funny :P Great shot, 10</td>', 'Lol, he looks so funny :P Great shot, 10', '2004-01-14 13:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(542850, 54555, 15642, '<td valign="top">It''s not so interesting inside a VCR.</td>', 'It''s not so interesting inside a VCR.', '2004-01-14 13:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(542851, 55083, 14836, '<td valign="top">Wow. Can''t get any closer then that! Nicely done.</td>', 'Wow. Can''t get any closer then that! Nicely done.', '2004-01-14 13:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(542852, 54311, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Needs to be a bit darker I think, still a 9</td>', 'Great shot. Needs to be a bit darker I think, still a 9', '2004-01-14 13:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(542853, 54341, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!</td>', 'Nice capture!', '2004-01-14 13:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(542854, 55088, 6130, '<td valign="top">Simple and I like it a lot.</td>', 'Simple and I like it a lot.', '2004-01-14 13:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(542855, 54356, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice. I would have preferred a shot without the birds zooming in.</td>', 'Nice. I would have preferred a shot without the birds zooming in.', '2004-01-14 13:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(542859, 54115, 14836, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell what this is!</td>', 'It''s hard to tell what this is!', '2004-01-14 13:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(542860, 54947, 15642, '<td valign="top">You have officially lost me here.</td>', 'You have officially lost me here.', '2004-01-14 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(542861, 54311, 15703, '<td valign="top">Not an especially complementary or exciting background.  A bit like my Canon''s version of white sometimes!  Thoughtful idea, and relevant. I wonder if having the whole bike in good focus would have made for a more satisfying photo?</td>', 'Not an especially complementary or exciting background.  A bit like my Canon''s version of white sometimes!  Thoughtful idea, and relevant. I wonder if having the whole bike in good focus would have made for a more satisfying photo?', '2004-01-14 13:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(542862, 54618, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the fact that it isnt sharply in focus. 10</td>', 'Great shot. I like the fact that it isnt sharply in focus. 10', '2004-01-14 13:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(542863, 54916, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of interest here...</td>', 'Not a lot of interest here...', '2004-01-14 13:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542864, 55095, 14836, '<td valign="top">A bit grey of a picture. Too bad it wasn''t a sunny day to bring out colors.</td>', 'A bit grey of a picture. Too bad it wasn''t a sunny day to bring out colors.', '2004-01-14 13:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(542865, 54399, 15642, '<td valign="top">Maybe a wider shot would have more interest</td>', 'Maybe a wider shot would have more interest', '2004-01-14 13:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(542867, 55086, 14836, '<td valign="top">Great point of view. Nice blues in the windows and sky.</td>', 'Great point of view. Nice blues in the windows and sky.', '2004-01-14 13:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(542868, 54762, 15642, '<td valign="top">Sunglasses, please!</td>', 'Sunglasses, please!', '2004-01-14 13:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(542869, 54975, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice clear picture. Good lighting!</td>', 'Nice clear picture. Good lighting!', '2004-01-14 13:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(542871, 54353, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice blue eye. Great detail. The title throws me as does the border.</td>', 'Nice blue eye. Great detail. The title throws me as does the border.', '2004-01-14 13:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(542872, 54341, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great capture, shame the bird isnt in focus, but still a great shot. 8</td>', 'Great capture, shame the bird isnt in focus, but still a great shot. 8', '2004-01-14 13:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(542874, 55119, 15642, '<td valign="top">Imposing and cool. Nice shot.</td>', 'Imposing and cool. Nice shot.', '2004-01-14 13:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542875, 54974, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice. Very dramatic. I like the soft focus idea.</td>', 'Nice. Very dramatic. I like the soft focus idea.', '2004-01-14 13:31:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(542876, 54687, 15703, '<td valign="top">This reminds me that I ought to be more creative and exploit more techniques myself. I don''t think this is a particularly powerful use of technique.</td>', 'This reminds me that I ought to be more creative and exploit more techniques myself. I don''t think this is a particularly powerful use of technique.', '2004-01-14 13:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(542877, 55118, 15642, '<td valign="top">No more guitar shots....</td>', 'No more guitar shots....', '2004-01-14 13:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(542878, 54980, 14836, '<td valign="top">Simple yet beautiful. Love the shadows.</td>', 'Simple yet beautiful. Love the shadows.', '2004-01-14 13:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(542880, 55031, 14836, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2004-01-14 13:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(542882, 55006, 14836, '<td valign="top">Different. A bit to dark perhaps.</td>', 'Different. A bit to dark perhaps.', '2004-01-14 13:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(542883, 54483, 15703, '<td valign="top">When I saw the thumbnail, I couldn''t wait to find out what the little diamond of light energy was!  An original idea, and challenge-relevant.</td>', 'When I saw the thumbnail, I couldn''t wait to find out what the little diamond of light energy was!  An original idea, and challenge-relevant.', '2004-01-14 13:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(542884, 54332, 14836, '<td valign="top">I like the  black background on this one!</td>', 'I like the  black background on this one!', '2004-01-14 13:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(542886, 55040, 6130, '<td valign="top">I have wonder how many pic with high score is taken in this way?It is a good pic on cheating.</td>', 'I have wonder how many pic with high score is taken in this way?It is a good pic on cheating.', '2004-01-14 13:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(542888, 54485, 15703, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours. A little bit pastel-like in texture.</td>', 'Interesting colours. A little bit pastel-like in texture.', '2004-01-14 13:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(542894, 54418, 15703, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. The hand covers just the right amount of face. Non-competing clothing, interesting background. Nothing especially exciting happening here, but I like this shot a lot.</td>', 'Nice picture. The hand covers just the right amount of face. Non-competing clothing, interesting background. Nothing especially exciting happening here, but I like this shot a lot.', '2004-01-14 13:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542917, 54935, 15703, '<td valign="top">I hope this isn''t a sad picture. I rescued an unwanted capuchin in 1996 and he has lived with me ever since. The most rewarding thing I have ever done. Technically, the warm brown fur and soft eyes are appealing, and I shall mark you with a 7 and move quickly on.</td>', 'I hope this isn''t a sad picture. I rescued an unwanted capuchin in 1996 and he has lived with me ever since. The most rewarding thing I have ever done. Technically, the warm brown fur and soft eyes are appealing, and I shall mark you with a 7 and move quickly on.', '2004-01-14 13:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(542921, 55121, 15703, '<td valign="top">A lovely, simple, clutter-free shot. I wonder if it''s an especially novel point of view.</td>', 'A lovely, simple, clutter-free shot. I wonder if it''s an especially novel point of view.', '2004-01-14 13:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542924, 54262, 15703, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.</td>', 'Interesting idea.', '2004-01-14 14:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(542925, 54929, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like this blend of light and dark. The texture and color of the bricks is good. Having "Stairs" in the title leads me to expect them to be in focus, but I like the DOF anyway.</td>', 'I like this blend of light and dark. The texture and color of the bricks is good. Having "Stairs" in the title leads me to expect them to be in focus, but I like the DOF anyway.', '2004-01-14 14:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(542926, 55094, 13136, '<td valign="top">I almost missed the reason behind being out of focus. No glasses or contacts in yet, no focus. Tricky. I hope not too many people miss that.</td>', 'I almost missed the reason behind being out of focus. No glasses or contacts in yet, no focus. Tricky. I hope not too many people miss that.', '2004-01-14 14:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542932, 55083, 2792, '<td valign="top">LOL, what a great caricature!  Love how exaggerated the size of the beak is.  Only complaint is that the cropping is just a little tight on the left and right sides.  Great job. 7</td>', 'LOL, what a great caricature!  Love how exaggerated the size of the beak is.  Only complaint is that the cropping is just a little tight on the left and right sides.  Great job. 7', '2004-01-14 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(542933, 54848, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. Even looks like you have mountains in the background.</td>', 'Nice concept. Even looks like you have mountains in the background.', '2004-01-14 14:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(542936, 54866, 14476, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge beautifully and is nicely composed.</td>', 'Meets the challenge beautifully and is nicely composed.', '2004-01-14 14:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(542938, 54289, 15703, '<td valign="top">I would have expected all the local populace who visited this building to have had a similar point of view to this one. However, as a photo, I love it.</td>', 'I would have expected all the local populace who visited this building to have had a similar point of view to this one. However, as a photo, I love it.', '2004-01-14 14:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(542943, 55087, 15703, '<td valign="top">I doubt if this background took much thought or many days to set up.  But the puss has a lovely little expression and clearly loves this photographer. So I am happy.</td>', 'I doubt if this background took much thought or many days to set up.  But the puss has a lovely little expression and clearly loves this photographer. So I am happy.', '2004-01-14 14:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(542945, 55144, 15703, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing photograph.</td>', 'A very pleasing photograph.', '2004-01-14 14:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(542949, 54225, 15703, '<td valign="top">I think you will do well. We humans love contact with other people, and this is the first visible person I have seen so far in this challenge. On top of that, your photo is of a very high standard - both in terms of quality of execution and originality.</td>', 'I think you will do well. We humans love contact with other people, and this is the first visible person I have seen so far in this challenge. On top of that, your photo is of a very high standard - both in terms of quality of execution and originality.', '2004-01-14 14:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(542951, 54761, 15703, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous tourist board shot. That water looks very powerful.</td>', 'This is a fabulous tourist board shot. That water looks very powerful.', '2004-01-14 14:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(542956, 54696, 15703, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very nice. Very unusual.</td>', 'Wow!  Very nice. Very unusual.', '2004-01-14 14:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(542959, 55058, 327, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors. Love the idea. Good luck in the challenge. 8 from me.</td>', 'Fantastic colors. Love the idea. Good luck in the challenge. 8 from me.', '2004-01-14 14:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(542960, 54564, 327, '<td valign="top">Lichen~ wonderful to photograph and we have plenty here in Oregon. This is a nice shot, and a good original idea.</td>', 'Lichen~ wonderful to photograph and we have plenty here in Oregon. This is a nice shot, and a good original idea.', '2004-01-14 14:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(542961, 55032, 327, '<td valign="top">Amazing place, hope to see more of this area from you.</td>', 'Amazing place, hope to see more of this area from you.', '2004-01-14 14:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(542962, 55124, 9941, '<td valign="top">The best "looking up the trunk" photo of the group!</td>', 'The best "looking up the trunk" photo of the group!', '2004-01-14 14:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(542964, 54835, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this  tones..the lighting and pose really came together.</td>', 'I like this  tones..the lighting and pose really came together.', '2004-01-14 14:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(542965, 54418, 327, '<td valign="top">Different, I like it. Good luck in the challenge. 7 from me.</td>', 'Different, I like it. Good luck in the challenge. 7 from me.', '2004-01-14 14:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(542966, 54675, 4591, '<td valign="top">At first glance the photo didn''t attrackt me, but it''s ability to hold the viewer surprised me.  The POV is unique, and the clarity of the dog''s eyes amazing due to the selective DOF.  Great job, and I like the contrast and the nice background.  <br/> <br/>Good work!</td>', 'At first glance the photo didn''t attrackt me, but it''s ability to hold the viewer surprised me.  The POV is unique, and the clarity of the dog''s eyes amazing due to the selective DOF.  Great job, and I like the contrast and the nice background.   Good work!', '2004-01-14 14:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(542967, 54947, 4591, '<td valign="top">Too fuzzy... my eyes are looking for more focus than what''s there.</td>', 'Too fuzzy... my eyes are looking for more focus than what''s there.', '2004-01-14 14:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(542968, 54674, 4591, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool pic... but it seems like there should be mroe in the background... to give the scene some sense of depth.</td>', 'It''s a cool pic... but it seems like there should be mroe in the background... to give the scene some sense of depth.', '2004-01-14 14:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(542970, 54677, 4591, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus to me.  This kind of shot is difficult.</td>', 'Seems out of focus to me.  This kind of shot is difficult.', '2004-01-14 14:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(542972, 54333, 4591, '<td valign="top">A classic bird shot - the white balance seems off (the white is too blue), but tha''ts just it... it''s a bit too "classic."  The POV doesn''t seem to add to the picture.</td>', 'A classic bird shot - the white balance seems off (the white is too blue), but tha''ts just it... it''s a bit too "classic."  The POV doesn''t seem to add to the picture.', '2004-01-14 14:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542973, 55118, 13136, '<td valign="top">The corner line in the center of the shot along with the dark part at the top are major distractions in this shot. A good idea not particularly well executed.</td>', 'The corner line in the center of the shot along with the dark part at the top are major distractions in this shot. A good idea not particularly well executed.', '2004-01-14 14:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(542974, 54204, 12962, '<td valign="top">Incredible perspective.  They look like encapsulated bacteria scurrying around.  It''s a pity that  some of the riders are in shadows and there''s a little bit of a gray cast that could have been easily corrected by adding just a little bit of contrast.  By doing so, you would also increase the vibrancy of the colors.  But anyhow, a beautiful photograph that fits the challenge.</td>', 'Incredible perspective.  They look like encapsulated bacteria scurrying around.  It''s a pity that  some of the riders are in shadows and there''s a little bit of a gray cast that could have been easily corrected by adding just a little bit of contrast.  By doing so, you would also increase the vibrancy of the colors.  But anyhow, a beautiful photograph that fits the challenge.', '2004-01-14 14:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(542975, 55097, 4591, '<td valign="top">This might have a unique POV - but it seems like the pic is too chaotic to get the feel for it.  Is that sensor dust on the outside edges of everything or JPG compresssion?</td>', 'This might have a unique POV - but it seems like the pic is too chaotic to get the feel for it.  Is that sensor dust on the outside edges of everything or JPG compresssion?', '2004-01-14 14:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(542976, 54217, 4591, '<td valign="top">Well done POV - cool picture with excellent colors and a great double image.</td>', 'Well done POV - cool picture with excellent colors and a great double image.', '2004-01-14 14:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(542978, 54619, 4591, '<td valign="top">Where is the unique POV?  THe picture is also just too dark... there needs to be more to lock my eyes on.</td>', 'Where is the unique POV?  THe picture is also just too dark... there needs to be more to lock my eyes on.', '2004-01-14 14:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(542979, 54763, 13136, '<td valign="top">This shot almost looks like the subject is supposed to be the scenery. Maybe more of the left should be cropped out?</td>', 'This shot almost looks like the subject is supposed to be the scenery. Maybe more of the left should be cropped out?', '2004-01-14 14:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(542981, 54796, 4591, '<td valign="top">An attempt at unique POV - from the ground... but I just can''t say it works for this one... the background is a little too chaotic and boring - the POV emphasizes this.</td>', 'An attempt at unique POV - from the ground... but I just can''t say it works for this one... the background is a little too chaotic and boring - the POV emphasizes this.', '2004-01-14 14:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(542982, 54155, 4591, '<td valign="top">Eye-level POV doesn''t add to the photo.  In its own right, the image does work, but the POV doesn''t seem, to me, to be a significant aspect of the photo.</td>', 'Eye-level POV doesn''t add to the photo.  In its own right, the image does work, but the POV doesn''t seem, to me, to be a significant aspect of the photo.', '2004-01-14 14:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(542983, 54225, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice self portrait ... appropriate for mirrorproject.com</td>', 'Nice self portrait ... appropriate for mirrorproject.com', '2004-01-14 14:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(542984, 55086, 4591, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, balanced, focused... SLIGHT barrel distortion, but not too much.</td>', 'Good DOF, balanced, focused... SLIGHT barrel distortion, but not too much.', '2004-01-14 14:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(542985, 55020, 13136, '<td valign="top">Aaahhh. Upside down. The ducks look right side up until examined closely. Too bad you could not have cropped out the grass on the upper right. Might have fooled me a few seconds longer.</td>', 'Aaahhh. Upside down. The ducks look right side up until examined closely. Too bad you could not have cropped out the grass on the upper right. Might have fooled me a few seconds longer.', '2004-01-14 14:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(542986, 54992, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  Love the play of shadows here.</td>', 'Nice macro.  Love the play of shadows here.', '2004-01-14 14:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(542987, 54922, 4591, '<td valign="top">Nice POV - right next to the trunk... but I can''t help but think it could be more interesting in Black and white.. just not sure - maybe some cool clouds and other colors would be helpful in the sky also.</td>', 'Nice POV - right next to the trunk... but I can''t help but think it could be more interesting in Black and white.. just not sure - maybe some cool clouds and other colors would be helpful in the sky also.', '2004-01-14 14:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(542989, 55094, 4591, '<td valign="top">Too blurry!!!  I know what you were trying to do with it, but it just doesn''t work for me.  If you want the viewer''s vision to look distorted because of the contacts out - go for something that looks pretty blurry too.  :)  Nice shot.</td>', 'Too blurry!!!  I know what you were trying to do with it, but it just doesn''t work for me.  If you want the viewer''s vision to look distorted because of the contacts out - go for something that looks pretty blurry too.  :)  Nice shot.', '2004-01-14 14:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(542991, 54509, 15703, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-01-14 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
