(543122, 54303, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, the colors pop and the details are very sharp. I really wish it used the whole 640 pixels allowed! 6</td>', 'Very nice photo, the colors pop and the details are very sharp. I really wish it used the whole 640 pixels allowed! 6', '2004-01-14 16:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
