(543137, 54227, 9939, '<td valign="top">good question! And great detail. 9.</td>', 'good question! And great detail. 9.', '2004-01-14 16:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(543138, 54500, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pointing the camera up a tree doesn''t strike me as interesting or requiring much imagination, as evidenced by the number of people who chose to do it for this challenge. At least shooting at a different time of day that offered a more interesting quality of light might have helped. Sorry, 2.</td>', 'Pointing the camera up a tree doesn''t strike me as interesting or requiring much imagination, as evidenced by the number of people who chose to do it for this challenge. At least shooting at a different time of day that offered a more interesting quality of light might have helped. Sorry, 2.', '2004-01-14 16:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(543139, 54824, 10799, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2004-01-14 16:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(543140, 54988, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pointing the camera up a tree doesn''t strike me as interesting or requiring much imagination, as evidenced by the number of people who chose to do it for this challenge. In this case, the fact that it''s a cactus only makes it marginally more interesting to me. At least shooting at a different time of day that offered a more interesting quality of light might have helped. Sorry, 3.</td>', 'Pointing the camera up a tree doesn''t strike me as interesting or requiring much imagination, as evidenced by the number of people who chose to do it for this challenge. In this case, the fact that it''s a cactus only makes it marginally more interesting to me. At least shooting at a different time of day that offered a more interesting quality of light might have helped. Sorry, 3.', '2004-01-14 16:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(543141, 54737, 9939, '<td valign="top">The glare coming off that white makes the entire photo washed out- lowering your shutter speed would have helped a lot and would have allowed more detail to be visible. I like the composition though. 4</td>', 'The glare coming off that white makes the entire photo washed out- lowering your shutter speed would have helped a lot and would have allowed more detail to be visible. I like the composition though. 4', '2004-01-14 16:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(543142, 55121, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good subject and a very lovely picture.  There is an overall gray cast that could be corrected (in Photoshop) by autolevels or added saturation (still within challenge rules).    It would also have more power if the two birds are offset toward the right side and not dead on center.  If you crop halfway from the bottom to the first set of wires and about two thirds from the right border to the first bird and probably about an inch from the top, you might end up with an improved composition.  It''s a lovely picture, don''t get me wrong.</td>', 'Good subject and a very lovely picture.  There is an overall gray cast that could be corrected (in Photoshop) by autolevels or added saturation (still within challenge rules).    It would also have more power if the two birds are offset toward the right side and not dead on center.  If you crop halfway from the bottom to the first set of wires and about two thirds from the right border to the first bird and probably about an inch from the top, you might end up with an improved composition.  It''s a lovely picture, don''t get me wrong.', '2004-01-14 16:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(543143, 55087, 9939, '<td valign="top">while the point of view is somewhat interesting, this really looks to me like nothing more than a snapshot with flash, which doesn''t require any effort or imagination. So many other submitters put a lot of work into their submissions, and it shows. 2.</td>', 'while the point of view is somewhat interesting, this really looks to me like nothing more than a snapshot with flash, which doesn''t require any effort or imagination. So many other submitters put a lot of work into their submissions, and it shows. 2.', '2004-01-14 16:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
