(543314, 54378, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pointing the camera up a tree doesn''t strike me as interesting or requiring much imagination, as evidenced by the number of people who chose to do it for this challenge. At least shooting at a different time of day that offered a more interesting quality of light might have helped. While the depth of field makes this a slightly more interesting shot, the small image size detracts significantly. Sorry, 2.</td>', 'Pointing the camera up a tree doesn''t strike me as interesting or requiring much imagination, as evidenced by the number of people who chose to do it for this challenge. At least shooting at a different time of day that offered a more interesting quality of light might have helped. While the depth of field makes this a slightly more interesting shot, the small image size detracts significantly. Sorry, 2.', '2004-01-14 18:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
