(543340, 55028, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the multiple pov references and a try at something different.  The little figure in the lower right is too small and fuzzy to make much of an addition here (I know he''s there for a reason but I''m not sure I can see enough of him to know why - guess is that he''s small so David looks big?)  The statue looks a bit tilted.</td>', 'I like the multiple pov references and a try at something different.  The little figure in the lower right is too small and fuzzy to make much of an addition here (I know he''s there for a reason but I''m not sure I can see enough of him to know why - guess is that he''s small so David looks big?)  The statue looks a bit tilted.', '2004-01-14 18:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
