(543343, 55146, 14614, '<td valign="top">Fuzzy base in the foreground is distracting.  I would like to see a more interesting background that might set off the statue a bit better. Otherwise, you''ve presented a different pov on this statue.</td>', 'Fuzzy base in the foreground is distracting.  I would like to see a more interesting background that might set off the statue a bit better. Otherwise, you''ve presented a different pov on this statue.', '2004-01-14 18:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
