(543727, 55137, 15242, '<td valign="top">Next time open the door and take the picture without the bars right in front of the camera</td>', 'Next time open the door and take the picture without the bars right in front of the camera', '2004-01-14 21:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(543728, 54205, 2195, '<td valign="top">If this is real I don''t see how it could have logically happened.  for one, the persons body seems unnatural, two, the hieght of the bullet hole "appears" to be lower than eye level, which I would assume to be the area of impact due to the blood at the head. But thirdly, I could be wrong, but the angle of the bullet upon impact of the glass appears to be at a right angle, but if that bullet were to hit the person in the picture it would have had to enter at an angle in closer approximation to the angle that the body is lying. I thus conclude it is staged, but nevertheless  clever take on the challenge. (7)</td>', 'If this is real I don''t see how it could have logically happened.  for one, the persons body seems unnatural, two, the hieght of the bullet hole "appears" to be lower than eye level, which I would assume to be the area of impact due to the blood at the head. But thirdly, I could be wrong, but the angle of the bullet upon impact of the glass appears to be at a right angle, but if that bullet were to hit the person in the picture it would have had to enter at an angle in closer approximation to the angle that the body is lying. I thus conclude it is staged, but nevertheless  clever take on the challenge. (7)', '2004-01-14 21:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
