(544219, 54361, 4494, '<td valign="top">LMAO, that is just bizzare!   This may be the best challenge fit of all the pictures.  It looks so real with the teeth biting into the corn.   Great job.  9.</td>', 'LMAO, that is just bizzare!   This may be the best challenge fit of all the pictures.  It looks so real with the teeth biting into the corn.   Great job.  9.', '2004-01-15 02:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
