(544222, 55032, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. I like the 3 different layered colors of the sea, it works in well with the lighter color of the sky. Does that lighthouse go far underwater?</td>', 'Wonderful composition. I like the 3 different layered colors of the sea, it works in well with the lighter color of the sky. Does that lighthouse go far underwater?', '2004-01-15 02:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
