(544420, 54808, 3724, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the mystery of this image &amp; location -  and find interesting  your (cropped and tilted?) angle of view,  which  encompasses  a necessary diagional to include all the chairs .  The repeated diagonal of the lens flare is a added bonus to the soft atmosphere to this composition.</td>', 'I enjoy the mystery of this image & location -  and find interesting  your (cropped and tilted?) angle of view,  which  encompasses  a necessary diagional to include all the chairs .  The repeated diagonal of the lens flare is a added bonus to the soft atmosphere to this composition.', '2004-01-15 08:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(544442, 54977, 15129, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are gorgeous, and I like the use of line. It seems like there is a lot of "noise" in it. (This may be my monitor, but I am not sure.)<br/>Cool picture.</td>', 'The colors in this are gorgeous, and I like the use of line. It seems like there is a lot of "noise" in it. (This may be my monitor, but I am not sure.)Cool picture.', '2004-01-15 09:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(544444, 55090, 15129, '<td valign="top">I love this idea, and it''s a cool picture. Good luck.</td>', 'I love this idea, and it''s a cool picture. Good luck.', '2004-01-15 09:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(544447, 54128, 15129, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this. Great use of reflection, framing and color saturation. Good luck. I hope it wins.</td>', 'I absolutely love this. Great use of reflection, framing and color saturation. Good luck. I hope it wins.', '2004-01-15 09:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(544449, 55022, 15129, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Wonderful pattern and colors. Good luck.</td>', 'Very cool. Wonderful pattern and colors. Good luck.', '2004-01-15 09:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
