(544885, 54165, 14608, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, but little too bright on the right.( Did cat catch the mouse?)</td>', 'Very interesting, but little too bright on the right.( Did cat catch the mouse?)', '2004-01-15 15:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(544890, 54855, 10047, '<td valign="top">I would have opted for the childs face to be in focus and blocks blurry. Good use of the angle.</td>', 'I would have opted for the childs face to be in focus and blocks blurry. Good use of the angle.', '2004-01-15 16:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(544893, 54834, 10047, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little on the dark side. I don''t know if taking out the interior lights would have helped or not.</td>', 'Maybe a little on the dark side. I don''t know if taking out the interior lights would have helped or not.', '2004-01-15 16:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(544894, 54856, 10047, '<td valign="top">The glass seems too centered in the frame and a little soft on the focus.</td>', 'The glass seems too centered in the frame and a little soft on the focus.', '2004-01-15 16:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(544896, 54972, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think it needs more contrast or little less exposure. Good angle and composition.</td>', 'I think it needs more contrast or little less exposure. Good angle and composition.', '2004-01-15 16:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(544897, 55095, 10047, '<td valign="top">Perhaps too centered and straight forward. A picture from the lower left or right might make it more interesting.</td>', 'Perhaps too centered and straight forward. A picture from the lower left or right might make it more interesting.', '2004-01-15 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(544898, 54751, 3317, '<td valign="top">if you''re creative enough to have people question the validity of your photo, that''s a great sign.</td>', 'if you''re creative enough to have people question the validity of your photo, that''s a great sign.', '2004-01-15 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(544901, 54155, 3317, '<td valign="top">the vertical line right in the middle''s a little troubling, maybe if you moved it to the right or left.</td>', 'the vertical line right in the middle''s a little troubling, maybe if you moved it to the right or left.', '2004-01-15 16:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(544902, 54974, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little disturbing, but good use of angles and reflections. The color contrast between the clothes and wall works well.</td>', 'A little disturbing, but good use of angles and reflections. The color contrast between the clothes and wall works well.', '2004-01-15 16:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(544903, 55095, 3317, '<td valign="top">yeah, school can blow chunks. that having been said, if you can learn how to learn about a subject you don''t care about, that''s a life skill that will serve you well.</td>', 'yeah, school can blow chunks. that having been said, if you can learn how to learn about a subject you don''t care about, that''s a life skill that will serve you well.', '2004-01-15 16:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(544905, 54836, 10047, '<td valign="top">Looks like a mean plant. I might have tried a wider crop on it to show more of the perspective.</td>', 'Looks like a mean plant. I might have tried a wider crop on it to show more of the perspective.', '2004-01-15 16:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(544906, 55089, 10047, '<td valign="top">Good angle and composition. Maybe a little too much backlighting. The colors seem washed out.</td>', 'Good angle and composition. Maybe a little too much backlighting. The colors seem washed out.', '2004-01-15 16:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(544910, 54383, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried the photo a little further to left, so it wasn''t so centered and to make better use of the sunlight. All that snow makes the sun seem even brighter.</td>', 'I might have tried the photo a little further to left, so it wasn''t so centered and to make better use of the sunlight. All that snow makes the sun seem even brighter.', '2004-01-15 16:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(544911, 54974, 3317, '<td valign="top">FYI, you''re supposed to slice a straight line, parallel to the arm (elbow to wrist), not across. of course that''s not what anyone should be doing anyways. especially not someone that young, life as a teenager can blow chunks, but it usually settles down after that.</td>', 'FYI, you''re supposed to slice a straight line, parallel to the arm (elbow to wrist), not across. of course that''s not what anyone should be doing anyways. especially not someone that young, life as a teenager can blow chunks, but it usually settles down after that.', '2004-01-15 16:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(544912, 54215, 3317, '<td valign="top">not just another cute cat picture.</td>', 'not just another cute cat picture.', '2004-01-15 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(544914, 54205, 3317, '<td valign="top">i''m gonna wanna hear the story on this one. ten for grabbing it. hope if anything that dramatic happens near me i''ll be confidant enough to take a picture. you should definitely win this challenge.</td>', 'i''m gonna wanna hear the story on this one. ten for grabbing it. hope if anything that dramatic happens near me i''ll be confidant enough to take a picture. you should definitely win this challenge.', '2004-01-15 16:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(544915, 54796, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think I might have cropped out the railing on the left so it didn''t distract from the steps, and removed the vertical  plant in the foreground.</td>', 'I think I might have cropped out the railing on the left so it didn''t distract from the steps, and removed the vertical  plant in the foreground.', '2004-01-15 16:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(544919, 54361, 3317, '<td valign="top">wow, gross. creative and well-composed and properly lit and gross.</td>', 'wow, gross. creative and well-composed and properly lit and gross.', '2004-01-15 16:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(544921, 55075, 3317, '<td valign="top">send this one to www.mirrorproject.com</td>', 'send this one to www.mirrorproject.com', '2004-01-15 16:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(544923, 55078, 14593, '<td valign="top">I was out and about photographing ducks at our local lake last Sunday, and I couldn''t capture a shot of two ducks together doing this....good shot!  I guess I will have to keep trying!</td>', 'I was out and about photographing ducks at our local lake last Sunday, and I couldn''t capture a shot of two ducks together doing this....good shot!  I guess I will have to keep trying!', '2004-01-15 16:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(544925, 55149, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice angle and good colors too.....</td>', 'nice angle and good colors too.....', '2004-01-15 16:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(544927, 55013, 12160, '<td valign="top">Works really well in b/w, composition and lighting both good. I wonder how it would look if the left eye was also dark. 7</td>', 'Works really well in b/w, composition and lighting both good. I wonder how it would look if the left eye was also dark. 7', '2004-01-15 16:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(544931, 54303, 14593, '<td valign="top">very different approach.....I am wondering why the subject is....Q-tips?  I like the composition....the cropping.....and the approach.</td>', 'very different approach.....I am wondering why the subject is....Q-tips?  I like the composition....the cropping.....and the approach.', '2004-01-15 16:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(544933, 54331, 14593, '<td valign="top">the birds look like missing leaves!</td>', 'the birds look like missing leaves!', '2004-01-15 16:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(544934, 54341, 10047, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how much room you had to work with, but I might have tried moving further to the left so as to omit the audience from the photo. You also might have snapped one second to late. The tail feathers seem to be more in focus. Looks like it was a thrilling experience non the less.</td>', 'Don''t know how much room you had to work with, but I might have tried moving further to the left so as to omit the audience from the photo. You also might have snapped one second to late. The tail feathers seem to be more in focus. Looks like it was a thrilling experience non the less.', '2004-01-15 16:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(544937, 55039, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here....not so sure I like the blurry front of the gun....that is probably just a matter of opinion</td>', 'I like the idea here....not so sure I like the blurry front of the gun....that is probably just a matter of opinion', '2004-01-15 16:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(544938, 54283, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nicely done in black and white, shallow dof works really well. 8</td>', 'Nicely done in black and white, shallow dof works really well. 8', '2004-01-15 16:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(544941, 54173, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried less of a crop on this to give the viewer a better feel for the perspective. Or maybe a little further away.</td>', 'I might have tried less of a crop on this to give the viewer a better feel for the perspective. Or maybe a little further away.', '2004-01-15 16:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(544943, 55098, 14593, '<td valign="top">DD has one of those faces!   I''m sure she or he is a sweet gentle dog, but I wouldn''t want to be walking around and come across that face staring at me....would be a little scary!!</td>', 'DD has one of those faces!   I''m sure she or he is a sweet gentle dog, but I wouldn''t want to be walking around and come across that face staring at me....would be a little scary!!', '2004-01-15 16:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(544945, 54935, 10047, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the fence, but maybe that is another perspective. Good capture of the expression.</td>', 'Too bad about the fence, but maybe that is another perspective. Good capture of the expression.', '2004-01-15 16:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(544949, 54888, 14593, '<td valign="top">a very cute creative idea.......well thought out, and captured nicely......</td>', 'a very cute creative idea.......well thought out, and captured nicely......', '2004-01-15 16:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(544951, 54843, 14593, '<td valign="top">a strange, different point of view!</td>', 'a strange, different point of view!', '2004-01-15 16:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(544955, 54660, 10047, '<td valign="top">Looks like the exhibit at the Ford 100th celebration this summer. Good perspective. The photo is sort of busy though and the display lighting on the right side wasn''t helping you out.</td>', 'Looks like the exhibit at the Ford 100th celebration this summer. Good perspective. The photo is sort of busy though and the display lighting on the right side wasn''t helping you out.', '2004-01-15 16:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(544956, 54837, 14593, '<td valign="top">love the different point of view.....the angle is fantastic!   I love these creative ideas, and wonder why I don''t have them!!</td>', 'love the different point of view.....the angle is fantastic!   I love these creative ideas, and wonder why I don''t have them!!', '2004-01-15 16:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(544957, 55005, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo, composition and lighting good, except for the purple fringing near the bottom left, not a biggie. IMO there''s not enough emphasis on pov but otherwise nicely done.</td>', 'Very sharp photo, composition and lighting good, except for the purple fringing near the bottom left, not a biggie. IMO there''s not enough emphasis on pov but otherwise nicely done.', '2004-01-15 16:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(544966, 55020, 14593, '<td valign="top">this photo is confusing to me.....maybe that is why it intriques me some!  A very different point of view!</td>', 'this photo is confusing to me.....maybe that is why it intriques me some!  A very different point of view!', '2004-01-15 16:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(544968, 55091, 14593, '<td valign="top">I rather like the building angles....I''ve always been a fan of such shots!</td>', 'I rather like the building angles....I''ve always been a fan of such shots!', '2004-01-15 16:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(544974, 54335, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective!    I rather like the strong lines, and find it puzzling too!</td>', 'interesting perspective!    I rather like the strong lines, and find it puzzling too!', '2004-01-15 16:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
