(545347, 54972, 1707, '<td valign="top">good flower to pick but photo would emphansize the title better if you could see the snow better.  For me, just looks like white paper.  snow has more texture than that.</td>', 'good flower to pick but photo would emphansize the title better if you could see the snow better.  For me, just looks like white paper.  snow has more texture than that.', '2004-01-15 21:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(545348, 54834, 15642, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but from a culinary standpoint may I suggest fresh lemon juice from now on?</td>', 'Interesting shot, but from a culinary standpoint may I suggest fresh lemon juice from now on?', '2004-01-15 21:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(545350, 54675, 12151, '<td valign="top">Your coor choice for the background was right on the money.  Simple but interesting photo.</td>', 'Your coor choice for the background was right on the money.  Simple but interesting photo.', '2004-01-15 21:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(545351, 54454, 12151, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of expression and pose, but the background is too bright; it steals away attention from the face.</td>', 'Nice capture of expression and pose, but the background is too bright; it steals away attention from the face.', '2004-01-15 21:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(545352, 54361, 15642, '<td valign="top">Wow. I may never eat corn again without thinking of this shot...</td>', 'Wow. I may never eat corn again without thinking of this shot...', '2004-01-15 21:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(545353, 55098, 15642, '<td valign="top">The forced perspective is interesting. One of the best pet photos I''ve seen on this site. This dog has attitude to spare. 8.</td>', 'The forced perspective is interesting. One of the best pet photos I''ve seen on this site. This dog has attitude to spare. 8.', '2004-01-15 21:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(545354, 54333, 1707, '<td valign="top">very cute little bird</td>', 'very cute little bird', '2004-01-15 21:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(545356, 55028, 15642, '<td valign="top">Cutesy.</td>', 'Cutesy.', '2004-01-15 21:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(545357, 54781, 15642, '<td valign="top">In two weeks I''ve already grown tired of guitar pic, but this one is slightly more interesting. FYI: time to change your strings.</td>', 'In two weeks I''ve already grown tired of guitar pic, but this one is slightly more interesting. FYI: time to change your strings.', '2004-01-15 21:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(545360, 54636, 12151, '<td valign="top">The irregularity and reds in this shot are appealing and a little unnerving, given the title.  The image does seem to be too dark at the top, however.</td>', 'The irregularity and reds in this shot are appealing and a little unnerving, given the title.  The image does seem to be too dark at the top, however.', '2004-01-15 21:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(545361, 54529, 15642, '<td valign="top">The mossy tree is cool, but the effect is a little jarring.</td>', 'The mossy tree is cool, but the effect is a little jarring.', '2004-01-15 21:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(545362, 54215, 1707, '<td valign="top">love the detail in this cat! good job, hope you didn''t have to get too close!</td>', 'love the detail in this cat! good job, hope you didn''t have to get too close!', '2004-01-15 21:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(545364, 54215, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of the eyes.  The blurred background effectively showcases the subject.  Though the body on the left is a little distracting, it does add a little bit more visually interesting stuff to look at.</td>', 'Very nice capture of the eyes.  The blurred background effectively showcases the subject.  Though the body on the left is a little distracting, it does add a little bit more visually interesting stuff to look at.', '2004-01-15 22:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(545365, 54617, 15642, '<td valign="top">When I used to take mushrooms I saw this stuff all the time. Nice shot.</td>', 'When I used to take mushrooms I saw this stuff all the time. Nice shot.', '2004-01-15 22:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(545366, 54363, 15642, '<td valign="top">Well put...8</td>', 'Well put...8', '2004-01-15 22:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(545367, 55126, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a very visually interesting photo - very nice abstract piece.  It looks very mechanical or digital.</td>', 'This is a very visually interesting photo - very nice abstract piece.  It looks very mechanical or digital.', '2004-01-15 22:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(545369, 55036, 15642, '<td valign="top">One of the best pairings of title and photo I''ve yet seen on this site. Bravo. 10.</td>', 'One of the best pairings of title and photo I''ve yet seen on this site. Bravo. 10.', '2004-01-15 22:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(545370, 54130, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not much to hold our interest here.</td>', 'Not much to hold our interest here.', '2004-01-15 22:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(545372, 54526, 15642, '<td valign="top">Cute. Maybe explore other executions of this idea.</td>', 'Cute. Maybe explore other executions of this idea.', '2004-01-15 22:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(545373, 54993, 1707, '<td valign="top">looks like jell-o</td>', 'looks like jell-o', '2004-01-15 22:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(545374, 55149, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract piece.  It seems a little off-center for some reason though, just slightly; this might be because the ice cubes aren''t centered in the middle of the cup.  But regardless it''s still very good, in an avante-garde kind of way.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract piece.  It seems a little off-center for some reason though, just slightly; this might be because the ice cubes aren''t centered in the middle of the cup.  But regardless it''s still very good, in an avante-garde kind of way.', '2004-01-15 22:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(545375, 54809, 15642, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. The lone building in the distance makes it for me. 10.</td>', 'I love this shot. The lone building in the distance makes it for me. 10.', '2004-01-15 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(545376, 55142, 15642, '<td valign="top">Creative way of seeing.</td>', 'Creative way of seeing.', '2004-01-15 22:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(545378, 55055, 12151, '<td valign="top">The way you''ve captured "shards" of black works nicely.  The image seems in between a charcoal draawing and a clean black &amp; white photo, and in this case, it almost works.</td>', 'The way you''ve captured "shards" of black works nicely.  The image seems in between a charcoal draawing and a clean black & white photo, and in this case, it almost works.', '2004-01-15 22:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(545379, 54974, 15642, '<td valign="top">Personally, I find the title too literal. Still, a powerful image nonetheless.</td>', 'Personally, I find the title too literal. Still, a powerful image nonetheless.', '2004-01-15 22:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(545382, 55134, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not an especially unique POV, but a nice shot.</td>', 'Not an especially unique POV, but a nice shot.', '2004-01-15 22:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(545383, 54843, 15642, '<td valign="top">The title is carrying a lot of the weight here. Cute, though.</td>', 'The title is carrying a lot of the weight here. Cute, though.', '2004-01-15 22:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(545385, 54702, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not bad. I hope you tipped him!</td>', 'Not bad. I hope you tipped him!', '2004-01-15 22:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(545386, 54300, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo in terms of composition.  It suggests a mix of slight meloncholy and slight awe.  The subject''s black silhouette and apparent adolescence, coupled with the sun at the horizon, evokes a strange sense of transition.  If you hadn''t titled your image with the word "sunset," it could possibly add more of a sense of mystery, as you can''t really assume if it\''s a sunset or sunrise based on the image alone.  Very good.  I would like this even more if you made it more surreal-looking, maybe.</td>', 'This is a very good photo in terms of composition.  It suggests a mix of slight meloncholy and slight awe.  The subject''s black silhouette and apparent adolescence, coupled with the sun at the horizon, evokes a strange sense of transition.  If you hadn''t titled your image with the word "sunset," it could possibly add more of a sense of mystery, as you can''t really assume if it\''s a sunset or sunrise based on the image alone.  Very good.  I would like this even more if you made it more surreal-looking, maybe.', '2004-01-15 22:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(545387, 54863, 15642, '<td valign="top">A bit corny for me.</td>', 'A bit corny for me.', '2004-01-15 22:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(545388, 54992, 15642, '<td valign="top">Clever!!!</td>', 'Clever!!!', '2004-01-15 22:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(545389, 55019, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is very good abstract composition; you managed to capture the blues, reds, whites, and blacks in a very attractive way.  It seems to suggest that you also paint or draw...  I must admit, though, that it seems to look better from afar.</td>', 'This is very good abstract composition; you managed to capture the blues, reds, whites, and blacks in a very attractive way.  It seems to suggest that you also paint or draw...  I must admit, though, that it seems to look better from afar.', '2004-01-15 22:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(545391, 55126, 15642, '<td valign="top">Much better than I hoped for from the title.</td>', 'Much better than I hoped for from the title.', '2004-01-15 22:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(545392, 55103, 15642, '<td valign="top">I had to read the title and look at the pic 3 times before it took hold. Nice way to attack this challenge!!! 8</td>', 'I had to read the title and look at the pic 3 times before it took hold. Nice way to attack this challenge!!! 8', '2004-01-15 22:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(545393, 54980, 15642, '<td valign="top">The snow''s too bright for me, but nice idea!!!</td>', 'The snow''s too bright for me, but nice idea!!!', '2004-01-15 22:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(545394, 54930, 15642, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA! I sit up here in Detroit and watch the Wings beat you guys all the time...Nice shot!!!</td>', 'HAHAHA! I sit up here in Detroit and watch the Wings beat you guys all the time...Nice shot!!!', '2004-01-15 22:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(545396, 54988, 15642, '<td valign="top">Another contestant had a slightly better execution of the same idea.</td>', 'Another contestant had a slightly better execution of the same idea.', '2004-01-15 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(545397, 54972, 15642, '<td valign="top">Kind of bright, eh?</td>', 'Kind of bright, eh?', '2004-01-15 22:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(545398, 54160, 15642, '<td valign="top">You got MY attention!</td>', 'You got MY attention!', '2004-01-15 22:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(545399, 54708, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the black background personally.</td>', 'Not a fan of the black background personally.', '2004-01-15 22:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(545410, 55010, 16095, '<td valign="top">really nice...good image balance</td>', 'really nice...good image balance', '2004-01-15 22:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(545412, 55084, 16002, '<td valign="top">What was this picture taken by someone that lives in a van down by the river!!! Does Pine have a camera??</td>', 'What was this picture taken by someone that lives in a van down by the river!!! Does Pine have a camera??', '2004-01-15 22:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(545416, 55083, 9411, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.. A goose candid!  I love it, really an excellent image. 10</td>', 'This is wonderful.. A goose candid!  I love it, really an excellent image. 10', '2004-01-15 22:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(545417, 54509, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very good, great you used b&amp;w, I  love this one. 10</td>', 'Very good, great you used b&w, I  love this one. 10', '2004-01-15 22:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(545418, 54692, 5822, '<td valign="top">colors and focus are outrageiously vivid. Detail and DOF are outstanding. Wonderful macro shot !!! 10</td>', 'colors and focus are outrageiously vivid. Detail and DOF are outstanding. Wonderful macro shot !!! 10', '2004-01-15 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(545419, 54866, 16025, '<td valign="top">I believe this photograph has the best point of view in this challenge.  You''ve creativly place the viewer inside the pill bottle.</td>', 'I believe this photograph has the best point of view in this challenge.  You''ve creativly place the viewer inside the pill bottle.', '2004-01-15 22:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(545439, 54506, 12160, '<td valign="top">Love this photo, it''s hilarious. Shallow dof works well, earth tone colors are nice too.</td>', 'Love this photo, it''s hilarious. Shallow dof works well, earth tone colors are nice too.', '2004-01-15 23:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(545443, 54155, 3080, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the bar from the window is dividing the photo  directly down the middle.  I think this could have had more visual power had the bar been on a 3rd.  Usually, I don''t try to push the "rule of thirds" but I do think it could have worked in this shot.  Also, while DOF is important, I think that it distracts a little here by making the left curtain oof and the right curtain sharp focus.  I like the point of view, and the shot has emotion.  Weather it be that you are looking out and glad your inside *which is my feeling* or looking out wishing you were out there.  Something to keep an eye on would be your background.  If there is a strong horizontal line, try to keep it horizontal.  I realize what you did here was to keep the strong vertical line vertical, which is also good, but your tree kind of looks like it''s going to slide off the left side of the world. :)  Very good idea for the challenge.  Good luck. ~Heather~</td>', 'Unfortunately, the bar from the window is dividing the photo  directly down the middle.  I think this could have had more visual power had the bar been on a 3rd.  Usually, I don''t try to push the "rule of thirds" but I do think it could have worked in this shot.  Also, while DOF is important, I think that it distracts a little here by making the left curtain oof and the right curtain sharp focus.  I like the point of view, and the shot has emotion.  Weather it be that you are looking out and glad your inside *which is my feeling* or looking out wishing you were out there.  Something to keep an eye on would be your background.  If there is a strong horizontal line, try to keep it horizontal.  I realize what you did here was to keep the strong vertical line vertical, which is also good, but your tree kind of looks like it''s going to slide off the left side of the world. :)  Very good idea for the challenge.  Good luck. ~Heather~', '2004-01-15 23:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(545444, 54859, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like this angle.  I''m glad that the yellow lines don''t lead directly to the tower.  I think that would have been "too lined up" for my taste.  Your focus and clarity are really good, and the foggy look in the background looks kind of cool.  Good idea for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like this angle.  I''m glad that the yellow lines don''t lead directly to the tower.  I think that would have been "too lined up" for my taste.  Your focus and clarity are really good, and the foggy look in the background looks kind of cool.  Good idea for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-01-15 23:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(545449, 54214, 12268, '<td valign="top">not sure how you could do it differently but the glare spots are a tad bit distracting.</td>', 'not sure how you could do it differently but the glare spots are a tad bit distracting.', '2004-01-15 23:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
