(545491, 55138, 3080, '<td valign="top">well..it''s a photo of an engine that has some hot spots and some dark shadows, both of which hinder detail.  i''m not seeing your interesting point of view.  when I pictured ''interesting point of view'' I thought about wow factor.  I thought about looking at the shot, and saying ''wow...great point of view''.  focus seems a bit soft too.probably a result of the poor lighting.  just not my kind of shot.  that''s just a personal preference though.</td>', 'well..it''s a photo of an engine that has some hot spots and some dark shadows, both of which hinder detail.  i''m not seeing your interesting point of view.  when I pictured ''interesting point of view'' I thought about wow factor.  I thought about looking at the shot, and saying ''wow...great point of view''.  focus seems a bit soft too.probably a result of the poor lighting.  just not my kind of shot.  that''s just a personal preference though.', '2004-01-16 01:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(545492, 55115, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice idea. wish the camera was not visible in the frame.</td>', 'nice idea. wish the camera was not visible in the frame.', '2004-01-16 01:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(545493, 55078, 9027, '<td valign="top">hehhee. very cute. good timing.</td>', 'hehhee. very cute. good timing.', '2004-01-16 01:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(545494, 54189, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s a good point of view...but there really isn''t anything to look at in the pic.  the view isn''t of anything interesting.  I don''t want to sound like a jerk when I say that, but there''s some powerlines, snow, and the butt end of a car, that we really can''t see much of anyway.  maybe if there were something to look at IN the mirror, it would have more of an impact on me.  even a snowman or something would have been somewhat interesting.  I think your idea was good, looking throught the mirror, but we really need something to look at. ~Heather~</td>', 'It''s a good point of view...but there really isn''t anything to look at in the pic.  the view isn''t of anything interesting.  I don''t want to sound like a jerk when I say that, but there''s some powerlines, snow, and the butt end of a car, that we really can''t see much of anyway.  maybe if there were something to look at IN the mirror, it would have more of an impact on me.  even a snowman or something would have been somewhat interesting.  I think your idea was good, looking throught the mirror, but we really need something to look at. ~Heather~', '2004-01-16 01:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(545495, 55087, 3080, '<td valign="top">did you use flash?  kind of looks like it the way the cats face is blown out and the rest of the photo is dark.  flash, or a really powerful lamp with directed light.  anyway, I do think the face has gotten too bright.  focus on the kat is a little soft, but the focus on the seat of the chair is great.  see how we get a lot of texture on the seat?  I wish we could have that texture on the cat instead.  looks like the auto focus focussed on the seat instead of the cat.  good point of view.  I like looking down on things in photos like this.  ~Heather~</td>', 'did you use flash?  kind of looks like it the way the cats face is blown out and the rest of the photo is dark.  flash, or a really powerful lamp with directed light.  anyway, I do think the face has gotten too bright.  focus on the kat is a little soft, but the focus on the seat of the chair is great.  see how we get a lot of texture on the seat?  I wish we could have that texture on the cat instead.  looks like the auto focus focussed on the seat instead of the cat.  good point of view.  I like looking down on things in photos like this.  ~Heather~', '2004-01-16 01:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(545496, 55039, 9027, '<td valign="top">i think it would have made more sense for the end of the gun to be in focus. (what is that blurry thing on the bottom?)</td>', 'i think it would have made more sense for the end of the gun to be in focus. (what is that blurry thing on the bottom?)', '2004-01-16 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(545500, 54854, 8891, '<td valign="top">I almost rather like the framing on this but the vignette is really killing the overall image for me.  Like the design, shapes and patterns, at leas the part I can see clearly....</td>', 'I almost rather like the framing on this but the vignette is really killing the overall image for me.  Like the design, shapes and patterns, at leas the part I can see clearly....', '2004-01-16 02:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
