(545528, 55081, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really strong shot here!  Very good idea, think it meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>The lighting here maybe could have been improved a little though.  The reflections on the glass, and the bright line on the label could have been avoided.  Maybe diffuse the light with some thin paper in front of your flash?<br/> <br/>Don''t get me wrong, I think your picture is really good.  The idea is great, the DOF you''ve used really adds to it on two levels.  If the person is drunk they will only be able to see what''s in front of them, and you''ve also shown the family as if it''s away in the distance from him.  Well done!  8</td>', 'Really strong shot here!  Very good idea, think it meets the challenge well. The lighting here maybe could have been improved a little though.  The reflections on the glass, and the bright line on the label could have been avoided.  Maybe diffuse the light with some thin paper in front of your flash? Don''t get me wrong, I think your picture is really good.  The idea is great, the DOF you''ve used really adds to it on two levels.  If the person is drunk they will only be able to see what''s in front of them, and you''ve also shown the family as if it''s away in the distance from him.  Well done!  8', '2004-01-16 03:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(545529, 54956, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very well seen. Artistic. One of my favorite here -9-</td>', 'Very well seen. Artistic. One of my favorite here -9-', '2004-01-16 03:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
