(545534, 54617, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I like the symmetry of the trees here.  If it was one tree on it''s own I don''t think I would have scored you that high. But, because you''ve gone a bit differently here and put a tree in each corner, it makes this look better!  9</td>', 'Good idea, I like the symmetry of the trees here.  If it was one tree on it''s own I don''t think I would have scored you that high. But, because you''ve gone a bit differently here and put a tree in each corner, it makes this look better!  9', '2004-01-16 03:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
