(545545, 55107, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very good geometric picture due to the point of view.</td>', 'Very good geometric picture due to the point of view.', '2004-01-16 03:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(545547, 55058, 11248, '<td valign="top">The point of view created a very nice abstract picture here. Very well seen. -8</td>', 'The point of view created a very nice abstract picture here. Very well seen. -8', '2004-01-16 03:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(545557, 55004, 11800, '<td valign="top">Dof,  light and exposure good. Idea good. Lines: I would like to see what this looks like if it had been taken with the slats angled off to the left. I feel it would have been more dramatic if the curve had not been cut off on the bottom. Maybe try stepping back a bit would help?</td>', 'Dof,  light and exposure good. Idea good. Lines: I would like to see what this looks like if it had been taken with the slats angled off to the left. I feel it would have been more dramatic if the curve had not been cut off on the bottom. Maybe try stepping back a bit would help?', '2004-01-16 04:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(545562, 55017, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the rich color of the wall and the angle the table was taken at. The props: maybe if they were related, they would have more impact. For example: a butterfly to go with the mag glass or a notecard to go with the pen holder. Did you try cropping out the extra portion over on the left? Over all, a pleasant picture to look at.</td>', 'I like the rich color of the wall and the angle the table was taken at. The props: maybe if they were related, they would have more impact. For example: a butterfly to go with the mag glass or a notecard to go with the pen holder. Did you try cropping out the extra portion over on the left? Over all, a pleasant picture to look at.', '2004-01-16 04:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(545564, 54551, 11800, '<td valign="top">The exposure is correct. The front chips look good. I think all the other stuff in the shot throws it off. A few things I see that might help are: <br/>1. Focus. The real chips blend in with what I perceive are the chips that are part of the packaging.<br/>2. Too much info cramed into shot.  <br/>3. The colors seem to be off. They seem dull and I think they should be brighter.<br/>4. The package is mirrored. It''s disconcerting to see writing that is backwards.<br/>Tha''s only my opinion. Maybe you did all this on purpose.</td>', 'The exposure is correct. The front chips look good. I think all the other stuff in the shot throws it off. A few things I see that might help are: 1. Focus. The real chips blend in with what I perceive are the chips that are part of the packaging.2. Too much info cramed into shot.  3. The colors seem to be off. They seem dull and I think they should be brighter.4. The package is mirrored. It''s disconcerting to see writing that is backwards.Tha''s only my opinion. Maybe you did all this on purpose.', '2004-01-16 04:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(545568, 54809, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. A thoughtful photograph that asks a lot of questions. The placement of the building in the frame provides a good reference point. I feel uncomfotable looking at the sculpture cut in half and think it might be interesting to see this as a vertically formatted composition containing man, mountain and building.</td>', 'Nice tones. A thoughtful photograph that asks a lot of questions. The placement of the building in the frame provides a good reference point. I feel uncomfotable looking at the sculpture cut in half and think it might be interesting to see this as a vertically formatted composition containing man, mountain and building.', '2004-01-16 05:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(545569, 54733, 11800, '<td valign="top">What is beautiful to one person might be considered a flaw to another.  I try to use flares as part of a composition, not as the composition itself. Personal preference.</td>', 'What is beautiful to one person might be considered a flaw to another.  I try to use flares as part of a composition, not as the composition itself. Personal preference.', '2004-01-16 05:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(545573, 54692, 11457, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and textures. I don''t like the border (even if it''s okay color-wise).</td>', 'Very nice composition and textures. I don''t like the border (even if it''s okay color-wise).', '2004-01-16 06:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(545574, 55116, 14155, '<td valign="top">Beautiful perspective. Great photo!</td>', 'Beautiful perspective. Great photo!', '2004-01-16 06:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(545576, 55072, 8891, '<td valign="top">your framing of this accentuates the lense distortion....nice pic: tones, focus...A closer angle and not in the the frame but the machines and windows might have made a better abstract.</td>', 'your framing of this accentuates the lense distortion....nice pic: tones, focus...A closer angle and not in the the frame but the machines and windows might have made a better abstract.', '2004-01-16 06:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(545577, 54381, 8891, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure how well this fits this challange, but the lighting is super and the shadws great.....like it all the same.</td>', 'i''m not sure how well this fits this challange, but the lighting is super and the shadws great.....like it all the same.', '2004-01-16 06:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(545583, 55148, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is adorable. The lighting is terrific, you captured the color wonderfully, the extreme close up definitely shows point of view :) 9</td>', 'This is adorable. The lighting is terrific, you captured the color wonderfully, the extreme close up definitely shows point of view :) 9', '2004-01-16 07:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(545586, 54513, 10848, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. The exposure is great. I like the angle in which this was taken also. 10</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. The exposure is great. I like the angle in which this was taken also. 10', '2004-01-16 07:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(545588, 55020, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a very imaginative shot, great contrast and detail. 8</td>', 'This is a very imaginative shot, great contrast and detail. 8', '2004-01-16 07:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(545599, 54208, 14951, '<td valign="top">hehe cool! :) it could be a little sharper tho, but i love it of course! :))</td>', 'hehe cool! :) it could be a little sharper tho, but i love it of course! :))', '2004-01-16 07:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(545617, 54225, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love doing shots like this.  If you look closely, I''m in 6 or 7 of my own challenge entries.  The one thing I don''t like about this oneis you can see the camera on tripod.  Nice take on the self portrait AND camera angles though!<br/>TC</td>', 'I love doing shots like this.  If you look closely, I''m in 6 or 7 of my own challenge entries.  The one thing I don''t like about this oneis you can see the camera on tripod.  Nice take on the self portrait AND camera angles though!TC', '2004-01-16 08:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(545620, 54363, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Would like to see the color version (I almost always say this on B/W images) and after challenge would love to play with this in duo-tone (if you don''t mind.)<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice!  Would like to see the color version (I almost always say this on B/W images) and after challenge would love to play with this in duo-tone (if you don''t mind.)TC', '2004-01-16 08:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(545621, 54831, 9906, '<td valign="top">You appear to have cropped to far on left and bottom...<br/>TC</td>', 'You appear to have cropped to far on left and bottom...TC', '2004-01-16 08:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(545623, 54620, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast.  You can''t tell where star ends and shadow begins....<br/>TC</td>', 'Too much contrast.  You can''t tell where star ends and shadow begins....TC', '2004-01-16 08:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(545624, 55083, 9906, '<td valign="top">How the heck did you get THIS close to even a tame goose?  DOF is a touch shallow and focal point is not where I would like to see it, but I''ll give up those two points this time on this shot...<br/>TC</td>', 'How the heck did you get THIS close to even a tame goose?  DOF is a touch shallow and focal point is not where I would like to see it, but I''ll give up those two points this time on this shot...TC', '2004-01-16 08:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(545630, 54666, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too small....I can''t tell what I''m looking at...<br/>TC</td>', 'Too small....I can''t tell what I''m looking at...TC', '2004-01-16 08:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(545632, 55129, 9906, '<td valign="top">Considering that you have total control in shots like this, it''s the little things that make or break the picture.  Little things like the tea light is bent...  I know I (and others) tend to vote a little more critically on set up shots.<br/>TC</td>', 'Considering that you have total control in shots like this, it''s the little things that make or break the picture.  Little things like the tea light is bent...  I know I (and others) tend to vote a little more critically on set up shots.TC', '2004-01-16 08:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(545633, 54983, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is very small...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is very small...TC', '2004-01-16 08:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(545634, 55122, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is way overexposed, but nice composition for the challenge.  Is that the lens cover on the right hand side?<br/>TC</td>', 'This is way overexposed, but nice composition for the challenge.  Is that the lens cover on the right hand side?TC', '2004-01-16 08:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(545654, 55115, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like the photo. Great point of view. I wish that some way, you could not see the camera in the picture. Good job!</td>', 'I like the photo. Great point of view. I wish that some way, you could not see the camera in the picture. Good job!', '2004-01-16 09:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(545657, 54993, 13772, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but it probably would have been better if the glare was not so harsh on the glass laying down and if you could not see the camera in the other glass. Did you use a glaussin blur for effect? Good work!</td>', 'Good photo, but it probably would have been better if the glare was not so harsh on the glass laying down and if you could not see the camera in the other glass. Did you use a glaussin blur for effect? Good work!', '2004-01-16 09:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(545658, 54958, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like your picture. Great work! Good composition.</td>', 'I like your picture. Great work! Good composition.', '2004-01-16 09:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(545660, 54737, 13772, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! Pretty cat. I think it would be better if I could see the cat better. If it could stand out and the background was blurred.</td>', 'Nice photo! Pretty cat. I think it would be better if I could see the cat better. If it could stand out and the background was blurred.', '2004-01-16 09:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(545661, 55131, 13772, '<td valign="top">Very interesting point of view. I like it!</td>', 'Very interesting point of view. I like it!', '2004-01-16 09:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(545675, 55074, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice blue background, good idea for the challenge.  Could have been sharpened more though, looks a tad fuzzy...  8</td>', 'Nice blue background, good idea for the challenge.  Could have been sharpened more though, looks a tad fuzzy...  8', '2004-01-16 10:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(545680, 54666, 2764, '<td valign="top">more pixels please</td>', 'more pixels please', '2004-01-16 10:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(545681, 54862, 2764, '<td valign="top">more pixels please</td>', 'more pixels please', '2004-01-16 10:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(545690, 55031, 3569, '<td valign="top">A Tweety view... I get it...</td>', 'A Tweety view... I get it...', '2004-01-16 10:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(545702, 55085, 3569, '<td valign="top">Excellent dof and sharpness.</td>', 'Excellent dof and sharpness.', '2004-01-16 11:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(545703, 54956, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the impressionistic effect but just wished you had cropped the bottom a little higher so as to eliminate the windsheld wiper mark. Also, I"m not crazy about the urban scene and would personally have preferred different setting, but that''s just me. Nicely done and creative.</td>', 'I like the impressionistic effect but just wished you had cropped the bottom a little higher so as to eliminate the windsheld wiper mark. Also, I"m not crazy about the urban scene and would personally have preferred different setting, but that''s just me. Nicely done and creative.', '2004-01-16 11:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(545707, 54970, 5822, '<td valign="top">Appears to me to be washed out some.  Nice scene, although it''s not a special POV to me.</td>', 'Appears to me to be washed out some.  Nice scene, although it''s not a special POV to me.', '2004-01-16 11:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(545710, 54977, 5822, '<td valign="top">There is too much noise in this image which degrades picture quality greatly.  Also, the water is the main subject but seems too dark and to get lost in the buildings. I would have preferred if you''d zoomed in on one of the fountains and tired to capture the light reflecting in it than the big scene you''ve captured.</td>', 'There is too much noise in this image which degrades picture quality greatly.  Also, the water is the main subject but seems too dark and to get lost in the buildings. I would have preferred if you''d zoomed in on one of the fountains and tired to capture the light reflecting in it than the big scene you''ve captured.', '2004-01-16 11:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(545712, 55117, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the creamy tones here but find the horizontal running black floor board interrupts the coherence of the image.</td>', 'I like the creamy tones here but find the horizontal running black floor board interrupts the coherence of the image.', '2004-01-16 11:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(545720, 54185, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and I like the contrasts you''ve captured without blowing out any of the highlights. I would have liked to have seen a little more of the texture of the metal though.  Also, if those are dust specks in the shadow areas you could have blown them out.</td>', 'Very nice composition and I like the contrasts you''ve captured without blowing out any of the highlights. I would have liked to have seen a little more of the texture of the metal though.  Also, if those are dust specks in the shadow areas you could have blown them out.', '2004-01-16 11:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(545727, 54128, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully done! I love the subtle and muted colors but especially the way you''ve captured the light and your POV really makes this shot providing a natural border. And I also like the way the water line leads the eye into the distance. Very well done. I hope this ribbons...it deserves it.</td>', 'Very beautifully done! I love the subtle and muted colors but especially the way you''ve captured the light and your POV really makes this shot providing a natural border. And I also like the way the water line leads the eye into the distance. Very well done. I hope this ribbons...it deserves it.', '2004-01-16 11:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(545734, 54116, 15642, '<td valign="top">This could be a CD cover...has a real playful vibe.</td>', 'This could be a CD cover...has a real playful vibe.', '2004-01-16 11:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(545735, 55094, 15642, '<td valign="top">Blurry, relatively uninteresting I''m afraid.</td>', 'Blurry, relatively uninteresting I''m afraid.', '2004-01-16 11:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(545736, 54618, 15920, '<td valign="top">Good POV.</td>', 'Good POV.', '2004-01-16 11:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(545737, 55107, 15642, '<td valign="top">Dizzying. Nice job!</td>', 'Dizzying. Nice job!', '2004-01-16 11:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(545738, 54920, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not terribly interesting POV.</td>', 'Not terribly interesting POV.', '2004-01-16 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(545744, 54204, 15642, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.', '2004-01-16 12:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(545745, 54303, 15642, '<td valign="top">This image would have more impact if a little larger without the border. Still very nice.</td>', 'This image would have more impact if a little larger without the border. Still very nice.', '2004-01-16 12:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(545746, 54835, 15642, '<td valign="top">The title is such a literal interpreation of the shot it doesn''t really allow the viewer to come up with his own POV. Still a nice pic.</td>', 'The title is such a literal interpreation of the shot it doesn''t really allow the viewer to come up with his own POV. Still a nice pic.', '2004-01-16 12:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(545754, 54634, 15920, '<td valign="top">Definately met the challenge.  I might have used a little less flash (or lighting) and had a few interesting shadows.</td>', 'Definately met the challenge.  I might have used a little less flash (or lighting) and had a few interesting shadows.', '2004-01-16 12:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(545755, 54993, 15642, '<td valign="top">A little washed out for my taste.</td>', 'A little washed out for my taste.', '2004-01-16 12:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(545756, 54831, 15642, '<td valign="top">What exactly makes them ironic?</td>', 'What exactly makes them ironic?', '2004-01-16 12:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(545758, 54976, 15642, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Lots to hold my interest here. Nice richness to the B &amp; W, too.</td>', 'Very nice. Lots to hold my interest here. Nice richness to the B & W, too.', '2004-01-16 12:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(545759, 54205, 15642, '<td valign="top">Wow. It looks very real. Whether it is or isn''t...still an impactful pic.</td>', 'Wow. It looks very real. Whether it is or isn''t...still an impactful pic.', '2004-01-16 12:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(545760, 55142, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great POV.  Crisper on the envelope would have made it a little better.</td>', 'Great POV.  Crisper on the envelope would have made it a little better.', '2004-01-16 12:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(545763, 54225, 15920, '<td valign="top">That is cool.  I especially like the multiple reflections.</td>', 'That is cool.  I especially like the multiple reflections.', '2004-01-16 12:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(545765, 55121, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I love the birds on the line. Any way to bring more depth or color out of the sky??</td>', 'Nice composition. I love the birds on the line. Any way to bring more depth or color out of the sky??', '2004-01-16 12:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(545767, 54854, 15642, '<td valign="top">Okay, but the vignette surrounding the shot is really distratcting.</td>', 'Okay, but the vignette surrounding the shot is really distratcting.', '2004-01-16 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(545771, 54661, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not terribly interesting visually, but nice shot as far as catching the droplets.</td>', 'Not terribly interesting visually, but nice shot as far as catching the droplets.', '2004-01-16 12:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(545772, 55086, 15642, '<td valign="top">Please tell me heaven doesn''t look like the regional headquarters of an insurance conglomerate.</td>', 'Please tell me heaven doesn''t look like the regional headquarters of an insurance conglomerate.', '2004-01-16 12:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(545773, 54124, 15642, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened perhaps? Edges and details are a little ziggy.</td>', 'Oversharpened perhaps? Edges and details are a little ziggy.', '2004-01-16 12:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(545775, 55037, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. Rich tones.</td>', 'Nice detail. Rich tones.', '2004-01-16 12:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(545777, 55047, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but the inside the fridge POV has played out. Enjoy the brew!</td>', 'Not bad, but the inside the fridge POV has played out. Enjoy the brew!', '2004-01-16 12:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(545778, 54985, 9939, '<td valign="top">"while the point of view is somewhat interesting, this didn''t require much effort or imagination. So many other submitters put a lot of work into their submissions, and it shows. 2."<br/> <br/>Strike that. You''ve taken great issue with the fact that I said this shot didn''t require much effort, so here is my revised comment. Hopefully you''ll find it more helpful:<br/> <br/>"While you might have spent Herculean amounts of effort to attain this shot, I would have preferred if that time and effort had been spent finding a more compelling, interesting and imaginitive subject to shoot, and to shoot well. 2 points for a somewhat interesting point of view."<br/> <br/>In other words, the score still stands.</td>', '"while the point of view is somewhat interesting, this didn''t require much effort or imagination. So many other submitters put a lot of work into their submissions, and it shows. 2." Strike that. You''ve taken great issue with the fact that I said this shot didn''t require much effort, so here is my revised comment. Hopefully you''ll find it more helpful: "While you might have spent Herculean amounts of effort to attain this shot, I would have preferred if that time and effort had been spent finding a more compelling, interesting and imaginitive subject to shoot, and to shoot well. 2 points for a somewhat interesting point of view." In other words, the score still stands.', '2004-01-16 12:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(545780, 54859, 15642, '<td valign="top">Love the detail of the road. Nice composition!!</td>', 'Love the detail of the road. Nice composition!!', '2004-01-16 12:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(545782, 54185, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not much to hold my interest here...</td>', 'Not much to hold my interest here...', '2004-01-16 12:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(545785, 54515, 15642, '<td valign="top">Interesting way of seeing...</td>', 'Interesting way of seeing...', '2004-01-16 12:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(545786, 54165, 15642, '<td valign="top">Clever, and the overexposure works great for you here.</td>', 'Clever, and the overexposure works great for you here.', '2004-01-16 12:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(545787, 54824, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.</td>', 'Nice detail.', '2004-01-16 12:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(545788, 54929, 15642, '<td valign="top">They don''t look all that surreal, but still a nice take.</td>', 'They don''t look all that surreal, but still a nice take.', '2004-01-16 12:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(545790, 54225, 15642, '<td valign="top">I wish I couldn''t see the tripod and camera in the knob, but still nicely done.</td>', 'I wish I couldn''t see the tripod and camera in the knob, but still nicely done.', '2004-01-16 12:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(545792, 55099, 15642, '<td valign="top">Interesting self portrait.</td>', 'Interesting self portrait.', '2004-01-16 12:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(545794, 54862, 15642, '<td valign="top">The image size detracts from the vastness of the landscape. In this case, bigger may be better.</td>', 'The image size detracts from the vastness of the landscape. In this case, bigger may be better.', '2004-01-16 12:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(545796, 54706, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice POV. I''d love to see that lighthouse against a blue sky but I realize those are in short supply.</td>', 'Nice POV. I''d love to see that lighthouse against a blue sky but I realize those are in short supply.', '2004-01-16 12:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(545797, 55010, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice use of neg space.</td>', 'Nice use of neg space.', '2004-01-16 12:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(545798, 55115, 15642, '<td valign="top">I wish I didn''t see the camera in the corner. Interesting nonetheless.</td>', 'I wish I didn''t see the camera in the corner. Interesting nonetheless.', '2004-01-16 12:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(545799, 54855, 15642, '<td valign="top">Cute and nice POV</td>', 'Cute and nice POV', '2004-01-16 12:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(545801, 54381, 15642, '<td valign="top">Graphically nice.</td>', 'Graphically nice.', '2004-01-16 12:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(545805, 54664, 15642, '<td valign="top">The cobblestone here is not really holding my interest</td>', 'The cobblestone here is not really holding my interest', '2004-01-16 12:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(545807, 54958, 15642, '<td valign="top">Stark and intense. I like the red shower curtain.</td>', 'Stark and intense. I like the red shower curtain.', '2004-01-16 12:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(545810, 54532, 7369, '<td valign="top">This photo looks like it comes from another world. It is a joy to look at the slight off-centre POV in this photo and watch all the different elements and lines. Combined with the black and white, the light, shadows and the distant landscape it makes this photo one of the best of this challenge (9).</td>', 'This photo looks like it comes from another world. It is a joy to look at the slight off-centre POV in this photo and watch all the different elements and lines. Combined with the black and white, the light, shadows and the distant landscape it makes this photo one of the best of this challenge (9).', '2004-01-16 12:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(545813, 54513, 11440, '<td valign="top">nice point of view</td>', 'nice point of view', '2004-01-16 12:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(545816, 55115, 13136, '<td valign="top">Great idea and wonderful shot. Too bad you couldn''t get the camera out of it.</td>', 'Great idea and wonderful shot. Too bad you couldn''t get the camera out of it.', '2004-01-16 12:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(545820, 54796, 13136, '<td valign="top">The steps and fence look terrific and hit hard when the picture comes up. Unfortunately, the washed out background takes alot away from this shot. If it''s possible to shoot this again when the sun is in position to light things more evenly, it could be great. Good luch with this pic.</td>', 'The steps and fence look terrific and hit hard when the picture comes up. Unfortunately, the washed out background takes alot away from this shot. If it''s possible to shoot this again when the sun is in position to light things more evenly, it could be great. Good luch with this pic.', '2004-01-16 12:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(545821, 55091, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice. I''m having deja vu because I just walked past this bldg. Toronto, right?</td>', 'Nice. I''m having deja vu because I just walked past this bldg. Toronto, right?', '2004-01-16 12:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
