(546597, 55078, 16053, '<td valign="top">great oportunity! It''s all about shoting a photo: sense or oportunity and being at the right time and in the right place in that moment.</td>', 'great oportunity! It''s all about shoting a photo: sense or oportunity and being at the right time and in the right place in that moment.', '2004-01-17 06:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(546600, 54217, 5822, '<td valign="top">What a great reflection! Clear and vivid .  Colors are great and welll composed, even with the small black triangular shape in the lower left.  Love the effect with the flower petals in the water...very surreal. Well done.</td>', 'What a great reflection! Clear and vivid .  Colors are great and welll composed, even with the small black triangular shape in the lower left.  Love the effect with the flower petals in the water...very surreal. Well done.', '2004-01-17 06:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
