(546819, 54262, 3080, '<td valign="top">It is an interesting point of view, however, I''m not sure that the photo triggers anything for me.  There is a lot more fuzzy area than actual subject, and the subject is so tiny, that it doesn''t seem like a point of interest to me.  I think that I wish the opening were larger and that there were less of the inside of the bottle showing.  Otherwise, interesting idea for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'It is an interesting point of view, however, I''m not sure that the photo triggers anything for me.  There is a lot more fuzzy area than actual subject, and the subject is so tiny, that it doesn''t seem like a point of interest to me.  I think that I wish the opening were larger and that there were less of the inside of the bottle showing.  Otherwise, interesting idea for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-01-17 14:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(546821, 54165, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great idea, not happy with the angle, too angular and a might blown out, but nice capture and POV. 6</td>', 'Great idea, not happy with the angle, too angular and a might blown out, but nice capture and POV. 6', '2004-01-17 14:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(546822, 54526, 8891, '<td valign="top">good idea, think that you may have been able to covey this better with a tighter crop and better focus on the subject (the boy) and less on the toy characters.</td>', 'good idea, think that you may have been able to covey this better with a tighter crop and better focus on the subject (the boy) and less on the toy characters.', '2004-01-17 14:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(546823, 54515, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting photo, but I''m not sure how I get the relation to point of view.  I''m thinking that for this challenge that we were suposed to use the way we see something to enhance how we view our subject.  In this shot, although it is a very nice shot... *stops in mid sentence*  Ok, I get it now.  I thought it was a desk lamp, but it''s a hanging light.  Kind of tricky.  The lighting is what this photo is all about, and it is very nice.  Focus and clarity are also good.  the point of view didn''t jump right out at me, but it is definatly there.  Nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'It''s an interesting photo, but I''m not sure how I get the relation to point of view.  I''m thinking that for this challenge that we were suposed to use the way we see something to enhance how we view our subject.  In this shot, although it is a very nice shot... *stops in mid sentence*  Ok, I get it now.  I thought it was a desk lamp, but it''s a hanging light.  Kind of tricky.  The lighting is what this photo is all about, and it is very nice.  Focus and clarity are also good.  the point of view didn''t jump right out at me, but it is definatly there.  Nice shot. ~Heather~', '2004-01-17 14:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(546825, 54763, 8891, '<td valign="top">I''ve ponder this one several times....I really want to like it more than I do cause it is such an excellent POV with great DOF.  But I cannot get by the blocking of the young girl by the rower. Do not know what you could have done to avoid it.</td>', 'I''ve ponder this one several times....I really want to like it more than I do cause it is such an excellent POV with great DOF.  But I cannot get by the blocking of the young girl by the rower. Do not know what you could have done to avoid it.', '2004-01-17 14:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(546827, 55117, 3080, '<td valign="top">The feet are very nice.  I like the from the floor point of veiw.  The legs look strange to me though.  Kind of ''not real'' looking.  Especially the right leg.  I''m not sure why it looks like this, maybe it''s the texture from the tights?  They seem flat, like they have no dimensions, and depth.  Your focus is really great on the feet, and the connection to the challenge is strong.  A great idea for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'The feet are very nice.  I like the from the floor point of veiw.  The legs look strange to me though.  Kind of ''not real'' looking.  Especially the right leg.  I''m not sure why it looks like this, maybe it''s the texture from the tights?  They seem flat, like they have no dimensions, and depth.  Your focus is really great on the feet, and the connection to the challenge is strong.  A great idea for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-01-17 14:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(546829, 55004, 8891, '<td valign="top">the angle is a little too high and too (my) left on this and field of view too wide for it to be effective.</td>', 'the angle is a little too high and too (my) left on this and field of view too wide for it to be effective.', '2004-01-17 14:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(546830, 55120, 8891, '<td valign="top">the left half of this is quite good. I wish I could see more of the right.</td>', 'the left half of this is quite good. I wish I could see more of the right.', '2004-01-17 14:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(546831, 54857, 8891, '<td valign="top">POV, not silly orientation. Nice portrait otherwise.</td>', 'POV, not silly orientation. Nice portrait otherwise.', '2004-01-17 14:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(546832, 54529, 8891, '<td valign="top">based on the title, you might have cropped some the strait tree trunks from the right side of the image.</td>', 'based on the title, you might have cropped some the strait tree trunks from the right side of the image.', '2004-01-17 14:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(546833, 55096, 8891, '<td valign="top">excellent image, like the graphic quality of it, the definition and the color and the symmetry works really great as well.</td>', 'excellent image, like the graphic quality of it, the definition and the color and the symmetry works really great as well.', '2004-01-17 14:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(546834, 55036, 3080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and lovely point of view.  I''d love to see this in fall or summer.  Seems like it''s a bit chilly here, and the trees aren''t leafy much.  I love how the light comes in on the wall inside, and your focus and clarity are great for the mood of the photo.  great spot for a photo op.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Beautiful, and lovely point of view.  I''d love to see this in fall or summer.  Seems like it''s a bit chilly here, and the trees aren''t leafy much.  I love how the light comes in on the wall inside, and your focus and clarity are great for the mood of the photo.  great spot for a photo op.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-01-17 14:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(546835, 54454, 3080, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit bright for my personal taste, but definately cute!  The point of view is good and the subject is beautiful.  I''d like to see this less bright on the white house, and also maybe a bit sharper focus on the baby''s eyes.  I''d love for the eyes to just pierce right through us.  Nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Seems a bit bright for my personal taste, but definately cute!  The point of view is good and the subject is beautiful.  I''d like to see this less bright on the white house, and also maybe a bit sharper focus on the baby''s eyes.  I''d love for the eyes to just pierce right through us.  Nice shot. ~Heather~', '2004-01-17 14:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(546836, 54807, 8891, '<td valign="top">well you may not have been quite low enough to present an ant''s point of view and if an ANT''s the field of view is far to great and too well defined....that, of course is neither here nor there cause the picture is really well seen and shot and like the line contrasts from the wall to the mirror, the distorted reflections and the curves....so great picture, title could use some work....and since I usually suck at titles: 10</td>', 'well you may not have been quite low enough to present an ant''s point of view and if an ANT''s the field of view is far to great and too well defined....that, of course is neither here nor there cause the picture is really well seen and shot and like the line contrasts from the wall to the mirror, the distorted reflections and the curves....so great picture, title could use some work....and since I usually suck at titles: 10', '2004-01-17 14:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(546837, 54520, 8891, '<td valign="top">you might re think framing an image in which the frame only accentuates the need for some rotation or camera distortion correction.</td>', 'you might re think framing an image in which the frame only accentuates the need for some rotation or camera distortion correction.', '2004-01-17 14:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(546839, 54214, 8891, '<td valign="top">I get this a lot so I have only to say that I really would have liked to have seen this in color.....the graphic is superb....only other nit would have been to rotate this more CW so that the 2 hectangular (8 maybe more) sided shapes would not be so level.  Nicely seen and shot otherwise.</td>', 'I get this a lot so I have only to say that I really would have liked to have seen this in color.....the graphic is superb....only other nit would have been to rotate this more CW so that the 2 hectangular (8 maybe more) sided shapes would not be so level.  Nicely seen and shot otherwise.', '2004-01-17 14:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(546840, 55076, 8891, '<td valign="top">except for the blow out on parts of some of the whiter of the stars, this is a very fine image....love the shadows and the superb composition.  I t appears that the gold stars might have been able to withstand the lighting better and I might suggest your having just switched the stars, IE put the gold stars where the white are and vice versa leaving the one gold star outside of the egg where it is. The line of color against all the neutral surrounding it might have been more appealing but I would have to see it.   Very well done.</td>', 'except for the blow out on parts of some of the whiter of the stars, this is a very fine image....love the shadows and the superb composition.  I t appears that the gold stars might have been able to withstand the lighting better and I might suggest your having just switched the stars, IE put the gold stars where the white are and vice versa leaving the one gold star outside of the egg where it is. The line of color against all the neutral surrounding it might have been more appealing but I would have to see it.   Very well done.', '2004-01-17 14:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(546841, 55090, 8891, '<td valign="top">good, its not a fridge...nice job containing the blowout.</td>', 'good, its not a fridge...nice job containing the blowout.', '2004-01-17 14:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(546842, 54630, 8891, '<td valign="top">like the back light and most of the color but I think the flower might have been more saturaated....also may cropping away the leaves below the flower, but the not those that are to the left and above....very fine DOF</td>', 'like the back light and most of the color but I think the flower might have been more saturaated....also may cropping away the leaves below the flower, but the not those that are to the left and above....very fine DOF', '2004-01-17 14:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(546844, 55142, 8891, '<td valign="top">this is a grea idea but you really needed to crop the top down to just envelope window and face, IMHO</td>', 'this is a grea idea but you really needed to crop the top down to just envelope window and face, IMHO', '2004-01-17 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(546846, 54618, 8891, '<td valign="top">subject is a bit too dark</td>', 'subject is a bit too dark', '2004-01-17 14:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(546847, 55039, 8891, '<td valign="top">the focus is to far back on the gun</td>', 'the focus is to far back on the gun', '2004-01-17 14:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(546848, 54863, 8891, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2004-01-17 14:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(546849, 54361, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great colors, wonderful symmetry....feel like I am watching something out of "Little shop of Horrors"...very well done....please tell how...so very cool...just a little gross but the detail and the colors more than make up for it.</td>', 'Great colors, wonderful symmetry....feel like I am watching something out of "Little shop of Horrors"...very well done....please tell how...so very cool...just a little gross but the detail and the colors more than make up for it.', '2004-01-17 14:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(546858, 54916, 14035, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract and grainy quality of this image - but am unsure how it meets the challenge topic.</td>', 'I like the abstract and grainy quality of this image - but am unsure how it meets the challenge topic.', '2004-01-17 15:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(546859, 54381, 14035, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph but I am unsure as to how it meets the challenge critera.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph but I am unsure as to how it meets the challenge critera.', '2004-01-17 15:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(546864, 55094, 14035, '<td valign="top">I love the concept. Very creative and imaginative. The photograph itself  is quite unfocused and the focal point seems to be the texture of the middle of the finger.  My suggestions for this image would be to (1) make sure the whole finger and fingernail is in the frame,(2) the focal point is the lens itself and is in crystal-clear  focus and (3) a slight adjustment of light angle and/or source to reduce the hot spots .</td>', 'I love the concept. Very creative and imaginative. The photograph itself  is quite unfocused and the focal point seems to be the texture of the middle of the finger.  My suggestions for this image would be to (1) make sure the whole finger and fingernail is in the frame,(2) the focal point is the lens itself and is in crystal-clear  focus and (3) a slight adjustment of light angle and/or source to reduce the hot spots .', '2004-01-17 15:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(546869, 54841, 12160, '<td valign="top">Somehow I like this. High contrast of colorful blur against dark always works.</td>', 'Somehow I like this. High contrast of colorful blur against dark always works.', '2004-01-17 15:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(546870, 55032, 12160, '<td valign="top">Great perspective... the height of the cliff was really emphasized. 8</td>', 'Great perspective... the height of the cliff was really emphasized. 8', '2004-01-17 15:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(546873, 54995, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view. I like the greenish tint. Too bad for the noise in the green circle around the bulb. You could also have used the rule of thirds here effectively. 7</td>', 'Nice point of view. I like the greenish tint. Too bad for the noise in the green circle around the bulb. You could also have used the rule of thirds here effectively. 7', '2004-01-17 15:37:11.000000', NULL, 1);
