(547169, 54165, 3540, '<td valign="top">I feel that you had a great idea, but lost a lot with this photo when the cat''s nose was lost behind the rodent.  High key is good, but this might be just a little too hot.  I like the angle however.</td>', 'I feel that you had a great idea, but lost a lot with this photo when the cat''s nose was lost behind the rodent.  High key is good, but this might be just a little too hot.  I like the angle however.', '2004-01-17 22:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
