(547219, 54956, 7810, '<td valign="top">neat shot nice abstract...I would have cropped alittle tighter on the bottom to keep every thing the same relating  to the effects of the water.I still like the shot though.<br/>It looks like an impressionist painting...well done</td>', 'neat shot nice abstract...I would have cropped alittle tighter on the bottom to keep every thing the same relating  to the effects of the water.I still like the shot though.It looks like an impressionist painting...well done', '2004-01-17 23:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(547220, 55121, 7810, '<td valign="top">love the negative space...cool shot</td>', 'love the negative space...cool shot', '2004-01-17 23:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(547230, 54970, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, good lighting, but I think it needs to have levels adjusted.  Seems not to have any real black, or subjectively speaking, appears very low contrast.  I understand you are trying to show POV here, but I am not sure the aesthetics are good for the placement of the bench.    I would guess a wider view, including the whole bench, might have been a bit better compositionally.</td>', 'Nice scene, good lighting, but I think it needs to have levels adjusted.  Seems not to have any real black, or subjectively speaking, appears very low contrast.  I understand you are trying to show POV here, but I am not sure the aesthetics are good for the placement of the bench.    I would guess a wider view, including the whole bench, might have been a bit better compositionally.', '2004-01-18 00:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(547231, 54217, 10275, '<td valign="top">This has got the be one of the best shots in this challenge. The colours really enhance this photo. Great angle. The clarity is amazing. Full marks for sure.</td>', 'This has got the be one of the best shots in this challenge. The colours really enhance this photo. Great angle. The clarity is amazing. Full marks for sure.', '2004-01-18 00:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(547233, 54632, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well thought out and executed.  Only nit is perhaps the feet relative to the seam in the wall.  But I like the ''"action pose".  I''m more mixed about the meaning of the inclusion of the flower,  but it does work aesthetically.</td>', 'Well thought out and executed.  Only nit is perhaps the feet relative to the seam in the wall.  But I like the ''"action pose".  I''m more mixed about the meaning of the inclusion of the flower,  but it does work aesthetically.', '2004-01-18 00:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(547236, 54532, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and contrast, great perspective effect, and an all-around nice shot.   Minor nit is the brighter slightly overexposed beam top right, could be burned in a bit outside of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful tones and contrast, great perspective effect, and an all-around nice shot.   Minor nit is the brighter slightly overexposed beam top right, could be burned in a bit outside of the challenge.', '2004-01-18 00:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(547240, 54636, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great idea and beautiful photo. It took me a while to figure it out. Nice perspective and depth. Colours go well with the scene. Like it a lot, cause it looks almost abstractive.</td>', 'Great idea and beautiful photo. It took me a while to figure it out. Nice perspective and depth. Colours go well with the scene. Like it a lot, cause it looks almost abstractive.', '2004-01-18 00:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(547241, 54720, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very "cool" perspective.  I liked almost everything about this shot. Maybe would have gone for slightly more depth of field.  With that flat sky, you could have gotten away with a little more detail on the reeds above the ice line, but that is a very minor suggestion.</td>', 'Very "cool" perspective.  I liked almost everything about this shot. Maybe would have gone for slightly more depth of field.  With that flat sky, you could have gotten away with a little more detail on the reeds above the ice line, but that is a very minor suggestion.', '2004-01-18 00:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(547245, 54720, 10275, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very interesting photo. Great contrast between the bottom and top portions. Great catch. Well done.</td>', 'Wow. Very interesting photo. Great contrast between the bottom and top portions. Great catch. Well done.', '2004-01-18 00:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(547246, 55091, 10275, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective here. Colours are great too. Is this Toronto? Like your photo a lot.</td>', 'Love the perspective here. Colours are great too. Is this Toronto? Like your photo a lot.', '2004-01-18 00:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(547248, 54160, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is funny. What was the person doing? The colour contrast is nice. Needs a bit of sharpening.</td>', 'This is funny. What was the person doing? The colour contrast is nice. Needs a bit of sharpening.', '2004-01-18 00:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(547251, 54837, 14967, '<td valign="top">Great!! kind spooky thinking there is someone in the dishwasher with a camara!!</td>', 'Great!! kind spooky thinking there is someone in the dishwasher with a camara!!', '2004-01-18 00:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(547269, 55022, 16266, '<td valign="top">interesting lines, and textures</td>', 'interesting lines, and textures', '2004-01-18 01:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(547270, 54926, 16266, '<td valign="top">fine picture.. not too intersting... cigarettes are in a pretty boring place in the image... spak dap in the center</td>', 'fine picture.. not too intersting... cigarettes are in a pretty boring place in the image... spak dap in the center', '2004-01-18 01:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(547272, 54863, 16266, '<td valign="top">sorta funny.. if it is supposed to be the point of view of the dear it should be taken in front of the horns, but then i guess you would loose the horns... i feel iam riding on the deer... but funn yyes</td>', 'sorta funny.. if it is supposed to be the point of view of the dear it should be taken in front of the horns, but then i guess you would loose the horns... i feel iam riding on the deer... but funn yyes', '2004-01-18 01:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
