(547274, 54831, 16266, '<td valign="top">too light, but interesting</td>', 'too light, but interesting', '2004-01-18 01:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(547275, 55078, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-01-18 01:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(547276, 54128, 16266, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2004-01-18 01:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(547277, 55083, 16266, '<td valign="top">great close up and detail, nice color and composition</td>', 'great close up and detail, nice color and composition', '2004-01-18 01:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(547278, 54929, 16266, '<td valign="top">interesting, nice colors</td>', 'interesting, nice colors', '2004-01-18 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(547279, 54976, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-01-18 01:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(547291, 54959, 16269, '<td valign="top">It may just be my love of maps, but I really am taken by this photo. I don''t know if you played around with it at all, but I wonder what it would look like with the pinpoint of the blue pushpin in focus. I really love the way this turned out. Nice work!</td>', 'It may just be my love of maps, but I really am taken by this photo. I don''t know if you played around with it at all, but I wonder what it would look like with the pinpoint of the blue pushpin in focus. I really love the way this turned out. Nice work!', '2004-01-18 02:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(547293, 54179, 16269, '<td valign="top">I love the title! And I love the clarity of the gold wrapper. Makes me very hungry for chocolate. Did you toy with having the "nude chocolate" with a bite taken out of it? Then I suppose you might have to call it "Exposed".. hehe. Very nice job on this one!</td>', 'I love the title! And I love the clarity of the gold wrapper. Makes me very hungry for chocolate. Did you toy with having the "nude chocolate" with a bite taken out of it? Then I suppose you might have to call it "Exposed".. hehe. Very nice job on this one!', '2004-01-18 02:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(547295, 54180, 16269, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I can really appreciate this one. I''ve tried it myself. I''m not much of a photographer, but I couldn''t get anything even close to eye-appeasing. This reminds me of Georgia Okeefe''s painting called "Lawrence Tree".. just the looking up at a tree like that.</td>', 'Ooh, I can really appreciate this one. I''ve tried it myself. I''m not much of a photographer, but I couldn''t get anything even close to eye-appeasing. This reminds me of Georgia Okeefe''s painting called "Lawrence Tree".. just the looking up at a tree like that.', '2004-01-18 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(547297, 55125, 16269, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is so beautiful! Where is this taken at? It''s much too pretty to be a troll''s lair, I think. More like.. pathway to tranquility or something!</td>', 'Oh, this is so beautiful! Where is this taken at? It''s much too pretty to be a troll''s lair, I think. More like.. pathway to tranquility or something!', '2004-01-18 02:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(547298, 54160, 16269, '<td valign="top">Heehee.. I''d be hiding my head in a hole, too, if someone took a picture of my backside! Very nice job, though! Leaves me wondering what''s down there!</td>', 'Heehee.. I''d be hiding my head in a hole, too, if someone took a picture of my backside! Very nice job, though! Leaves me wondering what''s down there!', '2004-01-18 03:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(547301, 55099, 16269, '<td valign="top">Ooh.. that''s a very neat point of view. It makes the viewer feel like they''re the photographer, setting up their shot.</td>', 'Ooh.. that''s a very neat point of view. It makes the viewer feel like they''re the photographer, setting up their shot.', '2004-01-18 03:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(547303, 54980, 16269, '<td valign="top">This picture is really touching. I always stop to look at little things like this. I love the texture of the snow. Beautiful work.</td>', 'This picture is really touching. I always stop to look at little things like this. I love the texture of the snow. Beautiful work.', '2004-01-18 03:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(547304, 54311, 16269, '<td valign="top">Wow! Incredibly inventive! I love the title.. this is really fantastic.</td>', 'Wow! Incredibly inventive! I love the title.. this is really fantastic.', '2004-01-18 03:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(547306, 54332, 16269, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this one. It really draws your eye.. great visual appeal and movement. It''s so neat how you can see the slender twig so well under the ice.</td>', 'I love the composition of this one. It really draws your eye.. great visual appeal and movement. It''s so neat how you can see the slender twig so well under the ice.', '2004-01-18 03:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(547307, 54763, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice moment.  I like the boat, the sunlight in the hair, and how clear the people are, but, the background could have been a little less blurred, as it might have added to the mood.  But, my opinion doesn''t really matter.  I''m guessing you got exactly the effect you wanted.</td>', 'Great shot, nice moment.  I like the boat, the sunlight in the hair, and how clear the people are, but, the background could have been a little less blurred, as it might have added to the mood.  But, my opinion doesn''t really matter.  I''m guessing you got exactly the effect you wanted.', '2004-01-18 03:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(547309, 55036, 16269, '<td valign="top">This looks like something out of a storybook. I love the way that the light just catches the smallest piece of the inside wall. It looks like a painting.</td>', 'This looks like something out of a storybook. I love the way that the light just catches the smallest piece of the inside wall. It looks like a painting.', '2004-01-18 03:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(547310, 55121, 15920, '<td valign="top">I would have zoomed in on the birds a bit more.  You still would have understood the power lines location, and the sky wouldn''t be so much of the image.</td>', 'I would have zoomed in on the birds a bit more.  You still would have understood the power lines location, and the sky wouldn''t be so much of the image.', '2004-01-18 03:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(547311, 54381, 16269, '<td valign="top">Ooh. It looks like you spent forever setting each little coil perfectly. It turned out beautifully.. I love the white background and soft shadows.</td>', 'Ooh. It looks like you spent forever setting each little coil perfectly. It turned out beautifully.. I love the white background and soft shadows.', '2004-01-18 03:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(547312, 55022, 16269, '<td valign="top">I love the color and texture of these! You can almost smell them.. really nice job.</td>', 'I love the color and texture of these! You can almost smell them.. really nice job.', '2004-01-18 03:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(547313, 54807, 16269, '<td valign="top">Whoah! Dizzying. I can hardly tell which way is up!</td>', 'Whoah! Dizzying. I can hardly tell which way is up!', '2004-01-18 03:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(547314, 54483, 16269, '<td valign="top">I really like this one! The glass and orange juice are in such perfect focus. Really exceptional photo.</td>', 'I really like this one! The glass and orange juice are in such perfect focus. Really exceptional photo.', '2004-01-18 03:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(547319, 54737, 15199, '<td valign="top">The over-exposure forces the detail to be lost.</td>', 'The over-exposure forces the detail to be lost.', '2004-01-18 04:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(547320, 54509, 15199, '<td valign="top">I love the way the head just pops out at you.</td>', 'I love the way the head just pops out at you.', '2004-01-18 04:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(547321, 54664, 15199, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, pity on the long title leaving nothing to imagination.</td>', 'Interesting idea, pity on the long title leaving nothing to imagination.', '2004-01-18 04:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(547322, 55122, 15199, '<td valign="top">Its not clear if the box is really a mailbox, especially that loopy thing on the right confuses things.</td>', 'Its not clear if the box is really a mailbox, especially that loopy thing on the right confuses things.', '2004-01-18 04:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(547323, 55078, 15199, '<td valign="top">Lovely Shot.</td>', 'Lovely Shot.', '2004-01-18 04:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(547324, 55096, 15199, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and hues. Very surreal.</td>', 'Very nice colors and hues. Very surreal.', '2004-01-18 04:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(547325, 54958, 15407, '<td valign="top">1 Picture = 1000 Words...<br/>I voted this as a great photo, of a great photo, hoping that it complies with the rules ?<br/>Well if not, thanks for sharing !<br/></td>', '1 Picture = 1000 Words...I voted this as a great photo, of a great photo, hoping that it complies with the rules ?Well if not, thanks for sharing !', '2004-01-18 04:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(547326, 54383, 15407, '<td valign="top">I like this a really cute shot and a great idea...   I wonder if a little sharpening and saturation would have made it a little nicer?</td>', 'I like this a really cute shot and a great idea...   I wonder if a little sharpening and saturation would have made it a little nicer?', '2004-01-18 04:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(547327, 54751, 15199, '<td valign="top">Awesome great shot. I love the idea, composition, even the grid is lovely. Only drawback is the long title really. ''Big brother'' alone would have been better I think.</td>', 'Awesome great shot. I love the idea, composition, even the grid is lovely. Only drawback is the long title really. ''Big brother'' alone would have been better I think.', '2004-01-18 04:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
