(547423, 54826, 3540, '<td valign="top">You should''ve done this photo without the clear pieces.  The white ones look great.  I love the way they look.  The clear ones are reflecting all kinds of stray light and are out of focus.But the white ones have a very peaceful surreal look to them and are well lit and well captured.</td>', 'You should''ve done this photo without the clear pieces.  The white ones look great.  I love the way they look.  The clear ones are reflecting all kinds of stray light and are out of focus.But the white ones have a very peaceful surreal look to them and are well lit and well captured.', '2004-01-18 08:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(547424, 54932, 13547, '<td valign="top">Wow, what is that? Great effect, whatever it is!  My only worry is the grass - it looks a little over-sharpened to me.</td>', 'Wow, what is that? Great effect, whatever it is!  My only worry is the grass - it looks a little over-sharpened to me.', '2004-01-18 08:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
