(547447, 54368, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective in this picture and how it leads the eye  to the oddly sitting/placed house and beyond that up the far mountain.  The large bolder in the left foreground also helps to balance the image and bring the eye back. The image has an appearance of digital art, maybe something done in Bryce, or similar, but I still like it very much.</td>', 'I like the perspective in this picture and how it leads the eye  to the oddly sitting/placed house and beyond that up the far mountain.  The large bolder in the left foreground also helps to balance the image and bring the eye back. The image has an appearance of digital art, maybe something done in Bryce, or similar, but I still like it very much.', '2004-01-18 08:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(547448, 55040, 13547, '<td valign="top">Who d''ya think u are, George Lucas?!  Prequel to the Macro Challenge would have worked as a title as well, or Episode I: The Phantom Fly....  (like the shot btw, great take on the challenge!)</td>', 'Who d''ya think u are, George Lucas?!  Prequel to the Macro Challenge would have worked as a title as well, or Episode I: The Phantom Fly....  (like the shot btw, great take on the challenge!)', '2004-01-18 08:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
