(547455, 54958, 16255, '<td valign="top">Someone''s obviously proud of their breast, but is that the point, or is it the slanted angle of the shot, or is it that the photographer is the person in the mirror, or the red coloring through the shower curtain?  I''ve missed the point.</td>', 'Someone''s obviously proud of their breast, but is that the point, or is it the slanted angle of the shot, or is it that the photographer is the person in the mirror, or the red coloring through the shower curtain?  I''ve missed the point.', '2004-01-18 08:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
