(547461, 54478, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is certainly an extreme angle of view, which does add a certain amount of abstractness to it. Well composed, and colors are good, but the image lacks in focus. Though it''s ok to show the ball blurred and in motion, the rest of the image, like the backboard and hoop, are not in focus and weaken the impact of this otherwise potentially good photo.</td>', 'This is certainly an extreme angle of view, which does add a certain amount of abstractness to it. Well composed, and colors are good, but the image lacks in focus. Though it''s ok to show the ball blurred and in motion, the rest of the image, like the backboard and hoop, are not in focus and weaken the impact of this otherwise potentially good photo.', '2004-01-18 09:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
