(547471, 54723, 15920, '<td valign="top">This would have been better if you had a guy come in and plaster over that window so the backgrouund would be more uniform.  But, barring that, nice shot.  I don''t usually notice the stairs, so full marks on the POV, also, I like the deep depth of field.</td>', 'This would have been better if you had a guy come in and plaster over that window so the backgrouund would be more uniform.  But, barring that, nice shot.  I don''t usually notice the stairs, so full marks on the POV, also, I like the deep depth of field.', '2004-01-18 09:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
