(547523, 55097, 10047, '<td valign="top">Received a cryptic PM from you thanking me for commenting on this photo, but I hadn''t . I thought since I took the time to look it up though I would give it a go. I try to stay ahead of how many I receive. I also try to leave comments on what I rate the highest and the lowest, but often times I don''t know what to say about the tweeners. Tweeners I define as bascially good photos, but they didn''t jump out at me.<br/> <br/>I like the color and contrast in this photo and all the different umbrella angles I can see while they are free falling. It looks like the tree might have pixleated or suffered from some over-sharpening. The little specks in the blue sky above the unbrellas are sort of odd also. None the less I think it is a good stop action shot.</td>', 'Received a cryptic PM from you thanking me for commenting on this photo, but I hadn''t . I thought since I took the time to look it up though I would give it a go. I try to stay ahead of how many I receive. I also try to leave comments on what I rate the highest and the lowest, but often times I don''t know what to say about the tweeners. Tweeners I define as bascially good photos, but they didn''t jump out at me. I like the color and contrast in this photo and all the different umbrella angles I can see while they are free falling. It looks like the tree might have pixleated or suffered from some over-sharpening. The little specks in the blue sky above the unbrellas are sort of odd also. None the less I think it is a good stop action shot.', '2004-01-18 09:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(547526, 54632, 6532, '<td valign="top">I like this one - one of my top pics.  Very unique idea.</td>', 'I like this one - one of my top pics.  Very unique idea.', '2004-01-18 09:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
