(549226, 54710, 15353, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title, but the image is great.  I am very amused by the superhero-to-superhero glare.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title, but the image is great.  I am very amused by the superhero-to-superhero glare.', '2004-01-19 16:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(549228, 54720, 15353, '<td valign="top">This is a really puzzling image.  I don''t really understand what I''m looking at, but it''s cool.  I wish the bottom of the image was either darker or had better detail, but I love how the ice splits the image from cheery blue to ominous black.</td>', 'This is a really puzzling image.  I don''t really understand what I''m looking at, but it''s cool.  I wish the bottom of the image was either darker or had better detail, but I love how the ice splits the image from cheery blue to ominous black.', '2004-01-19 16:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(549240, 54808, 15353, '<td valign="top">I really like the glowing section of the second chair, it really adds a lot to the contrast of the image.</td>', 'I really like the glowing section of the second chair, it really adds a lot to the contrast of the image.', '2004-01-19 16:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(549279, 54981, 15353, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, because the low perspective.  I wish the background was less distracting and that the specular highlights on the balls were less obtrusive, but I like the depth of field and the idea.</td>', 'I like the idea, because the low perspective.  I wish the background was less distracting and that the specular highlights on the balls were less obtrusive, but I like the depth of field and the idea.', '2004-01-19 16:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(549283, 54781, 15353, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea.  I like how it''s not immediately apparent what we''re viewing.  I wish table to the left was cropped somehow and maybe switch to black and white, or make the colors more interesting, but it''s interesting to look at.</td>', 'This is a cool idea.  I like how it''s not immediately apparent what we''re viewing.  I wish table to the left was cropped somehow and maybe switch to black and white, or make the colors more interesting, but it''s interesting to look at.', '2004-01-19 16:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(549285, 54478, 15353, '<td valign="top">This is a fun picture.  I wish the shutter speed was either slower or faster, I feel like it''s between being motion blurred or crisp.  But the new perspective definitely works for the Challenge topic.</td>', 'This is a fun picture.  I wish the shutter speed was either slower or faster, I feel like it''s between being motion blurred or crisp.  But the new perspective definitely works for the Challenge topic.', '2004-01-19 16:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(549291, 54931, 15353, '<td valign="top">This is just a beautiful picture to look at.  I love the choice of B+W.  At first I was going to suggest more contrast, but the gray really works for the overcast feeling I associate with this city.</td>', 'This is just a beautiful picture to look at.  I love the choice of B+W.  At first I was going to suggest more contrast, but the gray really works for the overcast feeling I associate with this city.', '2004-01-19 16:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(549293, 54863, 15353, '<td valign="top">This is comical and original.</td>', 'This is comical and original.', '2004-01-19 16:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(549315, 54692, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice macro image, and it would probably do well in a macro related challenge. Every photo is taken from some point of view, and very close is certainly a point of view, but I think the challenge was about something a bit different. Nice photo though!</td>', 'This is a very nice macro image, and it would probably do well in a macro related challenge. Every photo is taken from some point of view, and very close is certainly a point of view, but I think the challenge was about something a bit different. Nice photo though!', '2004-01-19 17:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(549329, 54205, 7711, '<td valign="top">holy shit. is that real? I don''t mean to be naive, but that''s disturbing in its realism.</td>', 'holy shit. is that real? I don''t mean to be naive, but that''s disturbing in its realism.', '2004-01-19 17:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
