(549682, 55035, 4007, '<td valign="top">It looks like there wasn''t enough light for this shot, so it ends up with a dark haze over the whole thing that mutes all the colors and contributes to a drab feeling on the whole.  The crowd, which you apparently intended to be central to the shot, need to be in better focus with more detail as well.  A neat idea for a shot, and pretty well composed, but the execution suffers here quite a bit.</td>', 'It looks like there wasn''t enough light for this shot, so it ends up with a dark haze over the whole thing that mutes all the colors and contributes to a drab feeling on the whole.  The crowd, which you apparently intended to be central to the shot, need to be in better focus with more detail as well.  A neat idea for a shot, and pretty well composed, but the execution suffers here quite a bit.', '2004-01-19 22:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
