(549685, 54610, 4007, '<td valign="top">I"ll grant that it''s a funny idea, but after that initial amusement there''s not much to this shot.  The execution here is good enough to understand what is going on but not good enough to give the shot any more depth than a quick chuckle.</td>', 'I"ll grant that it''s a funny idea, but after that initial amusement there''s not much to this shot.  The execution here is good enough to understand what is going on but not good enough to give the shot any more depth than a quick chuckle.', '2004-01-19 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
