(549977, 54418, 3306, '<td valign="top">Quite clever. Nicely composed and an interesting topic and message.</td>', 'Quite clever. Nicely composed and an interesting topic and message.', '2004-01-20 07:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(549978, 54513, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wonderful night city shot. Would have done well in the night challenge as well.</td>', 'Wonderful night city shot. Would have done well in the night challenge as well.', '2004-01-20 07:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(549996, 55083, 10705, '<td valign="top">Cute photo ... like the perspective ... wish the eye on the right were a little more in focus, but nice job!</td>', 'Cute photo ... like the perspective ... wish the eye on the right were a little more in focus, but nice job!', '2004-01-20 07:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(549999, 55084, 16349, '<td valign="top">The lights are interesting, however the blade of grass in the center detracts from the photos beauty.</td>', 'The lights are interesting, however the blade of grass in the center detracts from the photos beauty.', '2004-01-20 07:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(550002, 54361, 4517, '<td valign="top">not something you see everyday :) 10</td>', 'not something you see everyday :) 10', '2004-01-20 07:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(550012, 54974, 16349, '<td valign="top">rather tasteless</td>', 'rather tasteless', '2004-01-20 07:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(550019, 54205, 16349, '<td valign="top">how would the family feel?  It''s not just about the shock value, it''s also about the feelings of those involved.</td>', 'how would the family feel?  It''s not just about the shock value, it''s also about the feelings of those involved.', '2004-01-20 08:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(550026, 54796, 3540, '<td valign="top">Botton of the photo is exposed pretty well.  Top of the photo is blown out.  Personally I''d have left the bottom a bit darker and made the top just a little bit brighter than normal.  I feel that the top here is substantially more exposed than "normal"</td>', 'Botton of the photo is exposed pretty well.  Top of the photo is blown out.  Personally I''d have left the bottom a bit darker and made the top just a little bit brighter than normal.  I feel that the top here is substantially more exposed than "normal"', '2004-01-20 08:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(550028, 54918, 3540, '<td valign="top">The branches make for nice texture.  Greyscale works well with this subject.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'The branches make for nice texture.  Greyscale works well with this subject.  Interesting shot.', '2004-01-20 08:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(550032, 54368, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing and perfect exposure.  Nice scenery and good textures shown on the stuff nearest the camera.  Good work 8</td>', 'Excellent framing and perfect exposure.  Nice scenery and good textures shown on the stuff nearest the camera.  Good work 8', '2004-01-20 08:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(550054, 54551, 11096, '<td valign="top">This photo is so clear.  It feels like you could reach out and touch those chips.  And it does meet the challenge since it is showing us that food is seen from a totally different point of view by a dieter.</td>', 'This photo is so clear.  It feels like you could reach out and touch those chips.  And it does meet the challenge since it is showing us that food is seen from a totally different point of view by a dieter.', '2004-01-20 08:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(550056, 54632, 11096, '<td valign="top">Very clever and a really nice photo.  I like the way the only bright color is the flower.  And the shadow at the front of the photo puts emphasis on the fact that you are seeing from under the bed.</td>', 'Very clever and a really nice photo.  I like the way the only bright color is the flower.  And the shadow at the front of the photo puts emphasis on the fact that you are seeing from under the bed.', '2004-01-20 08:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(550059, 54713, 11096, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a little bit out of focus.  Have you tried using USM on it ?</td>', 'This seems to be a little bit out of focus.  Have you tried using USM on it ?', '2004-01-20 08:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(550060, 54741, 11096, '<td valign="top">Interesting but doesn''t "pop" out at you.  Could you use USM on it and make it stand out more ?</td>', 'Interesting but doesn''t "pop" out at you.  Could you use USM on it and make it stand out more ?', '2004-01-20 08:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(550086, 55142, 4906, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, but it would have a much better shot if the envelope filled the whole frame. Seeing the top edge really detracts from the photo.</td>', 'I like this idea, but it would have a much better shot if the envelope filled the whole frame. Seeing the top edge really detracts from the photo.', '2004-01-20 08:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(550088, 54596, 4906, '<td valign="top">I think the hands are a little too blurred. Just enough to suggest movement, would have been better.</td>', 'I think the hands are a little too blurred. Just enough to suggest movement, would have been better.', '2004-01-20 08:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(550092, 55035, 4906, '<td valign="top">A bit dark and doesn''t really show a point of view.</td>', 'A bit dark and doesn''t really show a point of view.', '2004-01-20 08:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(550096, 54993, 4906, '<td valign="top">Seems a little over exposed. The front glass should be cleaner. Nice idea though.</td>', 'Seems a little over exposed. The front glass should be cleaner. Nice idea though.', '2004-01-20 08:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(550100, 54981, 4906, '<td valign="top">The picture seems a bit yellow. Would have benefitted from a lower angled view or with a better background.</td>', 'The picture seems a bit yellow. Would have benefitted from a lower angled view or with a better background.', '2004-01-20 08:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(550103, 54664, 4906, '<td valign="top">Background ''horizon'' is titled. Nice idea.</td>', 'Background ''horizon'' is titled. Nice idea.', '2004-01-20 08:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(550105, 54834, 4906, '<td valign="top">A bit dark. Have seen better ''fridge'' shots in the challenge this week.</td>', 'A bit dark. Have seen better ''fridge'' shots in the challenge this week.', '2004-01-20 08:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(550106, 54341, 15353, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very tough shot to capture.</td>', 'This looks like a very tough shot to capture.', '2004-01-20 08:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(550107, 54762, 4906, '<td valign="top">The point of this isn''t very clear. You can see the camera in shot too - os that intentional?</td>', 'The point of this isn''t very clear. You can see the camera in shot too - os that intentional?', '2004-01-20 08:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(550108, 54702, 4906, '<td valign="top">A tricky shot to expose correctly, but the main subject seems under exposed.</td>', 'A tricky shot to expose correctly, but the main subject seems under exposed.', '2004-01-20 09:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(550110, 54959, 4906, '<td valign="top">Seems a little bright, but a good idea. I like the use of focus too.</td>', 'Seems a little bright, but a good idea. I like the use of focus too.', '2004-01-20 09:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(550111, 54116, 4906, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the use of focus on this. The blurred foreground obscures too much of the image.</td>', 'I don''t like the use of focus on this. The blurred foreground obscures too much of the image.', '2004-01-20 09:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(550112, 55107, 4906, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of perspective.</td>', 'Very nice use of perspective.', '2004-01-20 09:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(550113, 54204, 4906, '<td valign="top">Exposure seems a little on the dark side. Apart from that, I really like this shot.</td>', 'Exposure seems a little on the dark side. Apart from that, I really like this shot.', '2004-01-20 09:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(550115, 54361, 15985, '<td valign="top">ewww</td>', 'ewww', '2004-01-20 09:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(550119, 54610, 4906, '<td valign="top">:o)</td>', ':o)', '2004-01-20 09:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
