(550121, 54975, 4906, '<td valign="top">I''d have preferred the hand to be in focus.</td>', 'I''d have preferred the hand to be in focus.', '2004-01-20 09:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(550122, 54205, 14453, '<td valign="top">Strange.... But interesting!!</td>', 'Strange.... But interesting!!', '2004-01-20 09:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(550131, 54715, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think with just a little less exposure you might have been able to show more of the texture of the icicles.  I think its a good shot for this challenge.</td>', 'I think with just a little less exposure you might have been able to show more of the texture of the icicles.  I think its a good shot for this challenge.', '2004-01-20 09:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(550133, 54761, 8125, '<td valign="top">This looks like a postcard. Well done!</td>', 'This looks like a postcard. Well done!', '2004-01-20 09:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(550134, 55089, 8125, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit out of focus...</td>', 'Looks a bit out of focus...', '2004-01-20 09:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(550135, 55033, 8125, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus and the front of the picture is too bright - hard to have a subject that close to the onboard flash.</td>', 'Looks out of focus and the front of the picture is too bright - hard to have a subject that close to the onboard flash.', '2004-01-20 09:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(550137, 54751, 5532, '<td valign="top">very creative and very well done!  I would like to know how you got the reverse cell phone image.</td>', 'very creative and very well done!  I would like to know how you got the reverse cell phone image.', '2004-01-20 09:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(550138, 54666, 8125, '<td valign="top">This picture is too small, looks out of focus and possibly a bit underexposed.</td>', 'This picture is too small, looks out of focus and possibly a bit underexposed.', '2004-01-20 09:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(550140, 55133, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot.  I''m not sure how it fits into the technical scheme of things.  I guess I don''t care either.  This is a pretty cool technique with the glasses.  From the thumbnail all I could think of was "blowout city" but now that I see the image, I get it.  Good shot and a great idea.</td>', 'This is a neat shot.  I''m not sure how it fits into the technical scheme of things.  I guess I don''t care either.  This is a pretty cool technique with the glasses.  From the thumbnail all I could think of was "blowout city" but now that I see the image, I get it.  Good shot and a great idea.', '2004-01-20 09:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(550143, 54972, 8125, '<td valign="top">Exposure doesn''t look quite right, maybe it''s the white balance or a bit of both.  The focus seems soft on the flower and there is some detail lost.</td>', 'Exposure doesn''t look quite right, maybe it''s the white balance or a bit of both.  The focus seems soft on the flower and there is some detail lost.', '2004-01-20 09:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(550145, 54559, 8125, '<td valign="top">This shot is out of focus... maybe that was intentional though.  The use of b&amp;w is good.</td>', 'This shot is out of focus... maybe that was intentional though.  The use of b&w is good.', '2004-01-20 09:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(550147, 55086, 6668, '<td valign="top">very nice point of view used in this shot...nicely done.</td>', 'very nice point of view used in this shot...nicely done.', '2004-01-20 09:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(550148, 55031, 8125, '<td valign="top">The part of this shot that is in focus is the birdcage.  It is hard to see the dog, and there could possibly be a cat in there as well??? It might help to prefocus on the animals before taking the picture.  Also, your flash is pretty bright and the bars of the birdcage lost a lot of color and detail.<br/> <br/>Edit: just realized it was bird cage.... sorry.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-21 07:40:29.</i></td>', 'The part of this shot that is in focus is the birdcage.  It is hard to see the dog, and there could possibly be a cat in there as well??? It might help to prefocus on the animals before taking the picture.  Also, your flash is pretty bright and the bars of the birdcage lost a lot of color and detail. Edit: just realized it was bird cage.... sorry.', '2004-01-20 09:48:54.000000', '2004-01-21 07:40:29.000000', 1),
(550149, 54860, 8125, '<td valign="top">Good idea for point of view.  This shot is a bit out of focus...</td>', 'Good idea for point of view.  This shot is a bit out of focus...', '2004-01-20 09:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(550153, 54863, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good use of BW, great contrast. If I remember... the Deer´s eyes are below the horns. Are this deer a mutant? :))</td>', 'Good use of BW, great contrast. If I remember... the Deer´s eyes are below the horns. Are this deer a mutant? :))', '2004-01-20 09:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(550155, 54977, 6668, '<td valign="top">This shot is extremely grainy.</td>', 'This shot is extremely grainy.', '2004-01-20 09:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(550157, 54454, 5532, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I wonder how it would look in color?</td>', 'Great shot.  I wonder how it would look in color?', '2004-01-20 09:57:27.000000', NULL, 1);
