(550204, 54361, 13759, '<td valign="top">Yeah, completelly unespected POV! Congratulations. It´s creative. I think is not beautifull. But is interesting.</td>', 'Yeah, completelly unespected POV! Congratulations. It´s creative. I think is not beautifull. But is interesting.', '2004-01-20 10:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
