(550486, 54781, 13759, '<td valign="top">The guitar state says all the truth... I can´t enumerate the points that need some workaround. Starting with composition , walking to light, paasing over the focus. You take a slash picture. The idea itself is good. May be you can put the camera a bit far away from guitar to improve the usage of hiperfocal distance, this will help you to focus the botton of picture. The light... some can be placed under the gitar to enhace it´s silhuete. If you had used flash ligth, try to difuse it with some piece of toallete paper to avoide de overexposure in captors.</td>', 'The guitar state says all the truth... I can´t enumerate the points that need some workaround. Starting with composition , walking to light, paasing over the focus. You take a slash picture. The idea itself is good. May be you can put the camera a bit far away from guitar to improve the usage of hiperfocal distance, this will help you to focus the botton of picture. The light... some can be placed under the gitar to enhace it´s silhuete. If you had used flash ligth, try to difuse it with some piece of toallete paper to avoide de overexposure in captors.', '2004-01-20 13:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
