(550717, 54959, 5364, '<td valign="top">Good picture. Saturday morning I was just under the first "a" in Fareham</td>', 'Good picture. Saturday morning I was just under the first "a" in Fareham', '2004-01-20 17:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(550724, 55088, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if it was possible to get into a position where the light was in the middle of the net.  It would have made the compostion much stronger.</td>', 'I''m wondering if it was possible to get into a position where the light was in the middle of the net.  It would have made the compostion much stronger.', '2004-01-20 17:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(550729, 54289, 2158, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot - pity about all the noise.  I tried running it through neatimage and it looks great.  Send me a message with your e-mail address if you want to see the result.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot - pity about all the noise.  I tried running it through neatimage and it looks great.  Send me a message with your e-mail address if you want to see the result.', '2004-01-20 17:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(550733, 55040, 14620, '<td valign="top">Freakin'' Hilarious!  Excellent POV and DOF.  Nice twist!</td>', 'Freakin'' Hilarious!  Excellent POV and DOF.  Nice twist!', '2004-01-20 17:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(550734, 54356, 13735, '<td valign="top">Very interesting "merging" of (basically) two colours! Almost my favourite!</td>', 'Very interesting "merging" of (basically) two colours! Almost my favourite!', '2004-01-20 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(550740, 55022, 13735, '<td valign="top">Deserves to be among the first three! The colours almost tickle my nose!</td>', 'Deserves to be among the first three! The colours almost tickle my nose!', '2004-01-20 17:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(550742, 55105, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great tones here and the reflection of the hand in the bell is fantastic. I also love being able to see the finger print!  Nice composition. Only distractions for me are the glare at the bottom left of bell and the flaw in the background on the right.  But overall, excellent photo!</td>', 'Great tones here and the reflection of the hand in the bell is fantastic. I also love being able to see the finger print!  Nice composition. Only distractions for me are the glare at the bottom left of bell and the flaw in the background on the right.  But overall, excellent photo!', '2004-01-20 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(550744, 55147, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Colors here!  Very sharp picture and excellent placement.</td>', 'Beautiful Colors here!  Very sharp picture and excellent placement.', '2004-01-20 17:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(550746, 55149, 13735, '<td valign="top">So refreshing by itself!!! Bravo!</td>', 'So refreshing by itself!!! Bravo!', '2004-01-20 17:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(550750, 54509, 14620, '<td valign="top">Love it, Love it,  Love it! But I''m a sucker for good cat shots. :)  Great capture, great perspective and you did an excellent job with the tones here.  Nice contrasts.  I''d buy it, Nice Job!</td>', 'Love it, Love it,  Love it! But I''m a sucker for good cat shots. :)  Great capture, great perspective and you did an excellent job with the tones here.  Nice contrasts.  I''d buy it, Nice Job!', '2004-01-20 17:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(550752, 54781, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I find the background too cluttered on the left side.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I find the background too cluttered on the left side.', '2004-01-20 17:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(550754, 54227, 13735, '<td valign="top">The "silhouette" of a woman in the cold (Arctic?) wind is terrific too!</td>', 'The "silhouette" of a woman in the cold (Arctic?) wind is terrific too!', '2004-01-20 17:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(550761, 54977, 2158, '<td valign="top">This looks very washed out - either overexposed or lightened too much in post-editing.  With some levels adjustments and neatimage, it would look pretty good.</td>', 'This looks very washed out - either overexposed or lightened too much in post-editing.  With some levels adjustments and neatimage, it would look pretty good.', '2004-01-20 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(550764, 54859, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2004-01-20 17:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(550776, 54670, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very cool angle...I wonder if cropping out all of the land on the left would add to the impact of the angle?  Nice work.</td>', 'Very cool angle...I wonder if cropping out all of the land on the left would add to the impact of the angle?  Nice work.', '2004-01-20 17:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(550779, 54311, 8637, '<td valign="top">Litle more DOF on the front of the tire (near the lens) would have helped but very neat angle and fits the challenge.</td>', 'Litle more DOF on the front of the tire (near the lens) would have helped but very neat angle and fits the challenge.', '2004-01-20 17:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(550784, 54300, 2158, '<td valign="top">In my opinion you got a bit too close.  I''d have liked to see the full figure of the child.</td>', 'In my opinion you got a bit too close.  I''d have liked to see the full figure of the child.', '2004-01-20 17:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
