(550814, 55116, 14614, '<td valign="top">This sure is unique - I can''t really tell what I''m looking at.  I like the black/blue sides and the abstract quality.  One of my favs -9</td>', 'This sure is unique - I can''t really tell what I''m looking at.  I like the black/blue sides and the abstract quality.  One of my favs -9', '2004-01-20 18:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
