(550817, 54506, 14614, '<td valign="top">Yep, he''s different.  Interesting capture - very unique pov. Good dov  Well done. One of my top picks - 9</td>', 'Yep, he''s different.  Interesting capture - very unique pov. Good dov  Well done. One of my top picks - 9', '2004-01-20 18:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
