(550825, 55144, 14614, '<td valign="top">I would like more of the pipe in focus or 100% blurry.  Hot spot to right takes my eye off the subject.  Inventive blend of light/solid gold tones.</td>', 'I would like more of the pipe in focus or 100% blurry.  Hot spot to right takes my eye off the subject.  Inventive blend of light/solid gold tones.', '2004-01-20 18:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(550827, 54352, 14614, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the unique pov (wish the title/image could help me on that)  Mass on left is too dark to add interest and the isle in the middle is too far away and has little detail</td>', 'Not sure about the unique pov (wish the title/image could help me on that)  Mass on left is too dark to add interest and the isle in the middle is too far away and has little detail', '2004-01-20 18:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(550829, 54956, 2158, '<td valign="top">I think perhaps you should have pointed the camera a bit more upwards.  The colours of the buildings look more interesting than the street - too much grey in the foreground.  Alternately cropping about a quarter off the bottom and just to the left of the nearest car would look pretty good.<br/> <br/>That\''s just my opinion though.  It\''s pretty interesting as it is.</td>', 'I think perhaps you should have pointed the camera a bit more upwards.  The colours of the buildings look more interesting than the street - too much grey in the foreground.  Alternately cropping about a quarter off the bottom and just to the left of the nearest car would look pretty good. That\''s just my opinion though.  It\''s pretty interesting as it is.', '2004-01-20 18:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(550830, 54710, 14614, '<td valign="top">Superman is out of focus but the gray backdrop (not very intereting with the fold line and color) is crisp when it should be fuzzier.  Different from all the other entries but I don''t understand the title as it relates to the figures.</td>', 'Superman is out of focus but the gray backdrop (not very intereting with the fold line and color) is crisp when it should be fuzzier.  Different from all the other entries but I don''t understand the title as it relates to the figures.', '2004-01-20 18:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(550832, 54397, 16375, '<td valign="top">Amazing...the sharpness that you achieve from the relfection of the drip is excellent...if the drip is falling that would even make the photo stronger...</td>', 'Amazing...the sharpness that you achieve from the relfection of the drip is excellent...if the drip is falling that would even make the photo stronger...', '2004-01-20 18:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
