(551085, 54509, 6008, '<td valign="top">This looks almost like a cartoon cat. The fact that she''s standing up really enhances the almost caricature look of the close/wide angle. Black and white was a good choice too. Only negative would be what looks like a chair/table frame coming out of her head, but I bet it was quite difficult getting her to cooperate for the shot. One of my favs!</td>', 'This looks almost like a cartoon cat. The fact that she''s standing up really enhances the almost caricature look of the close/wide angle. Black and white was a good choice too. Only negative would be what looks like a chair/table frame coming out of her head, but I bet it was quite difficult getting her to cooperate for the shot. One of my favs!', '2004-01-20 23:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(551093, 54929, 6008, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I''m not sure what it is about it, but it just has a great richness to it. The dof is great, the color tone is great, and it has wonderful textures. It''s very three dimensional, very sharp. Really great!</td>', 'I really like this. I''m not sure what it is about it, but it just has a great richness to it. The dof is great, the color tone is great, and it has wonderful textures. It''s very three dimensional, very sharp. Really great!', '2004-01-20 23:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
