(551278, 54747, 15305, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for your comments!  I''m learning a lot from all you people participating in this site and I had several important insights about my first challenge participation. Now I know how to make it better and I''m looking forward for your comments in my next one.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for your comments!  I''m learning a lot from all you people participating in this site and I had several important insights about my first challenge participation. Now I know how to make it better and I''m looking forward for your comments in my next one.', '2004-01-21 01:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
