(551292, 54664, 9906, '<td valign="top">My original comment (though maybe a little harsh) still stands.  I like the shot in general.  I DID make an assumption that the photographer (You, Ami) had more controll over the shot!  Anytime that anyone with our camera has a shot that they think is worth entering is IMHO an accomplishment!  Good job Ami!</td>', 'My original comment (though maybe a little harsh) still stands.  I like the shot in general.  I DID make an assumption that the photographer (You, Ami) had more controll over the shot!  Anytime that anyone with our camera has a shot that they think is worth entering is IMHO an accomplishment!  Good job Ami!', '2004-01-21 01:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
