(551359, 54866, 15189, '<td valign="top">First, thanks to everyone who left comments.  As always they are appreciated.<br/>It seems a lot of people thought this shot would have looked better in color.  I vacillated over this for quite sometime before submitting the B&amp;W.  I''m providing the color version.  You be the judge.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=56193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15189/thumb/56193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15189/thumb/56193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15189/thumb/56193.jpg"/></a></td>', 'First, thanks to everyone who left comments.  As always they are appreciated.It seems a lot of people thought this shot would have looked better in color.  I vacillated over this for quite sometime before submitting the B&W.  I''m providing the color version.  You be the judge. ', '2004-01-21 02:30:17.000000', NULL, 0),
