(551423, 55014, 13368, '<td valign="top">I wish to thank all those who voted for this photograph and commented on it. <br/>Thank you Zeuszen for your deep comment: I immediately went to see your portfolio and I can actually see there are many similarities in our way of photographing.<br/>For those who thought this was the moon: actually it was the sun behind  a quite thick gaze.<br/>To those who scored this picture with a "1": it would be nice to know the reasons why, I never get offended for a 1 :-)</td>', 'I wish to thank all those who voted for this photograph and commented on it. Thank you Zeuszen for your deep comment: I immediately went to see your portfolio and I can actually see there are many similarities in our way of photographing.For those who thought this was the moon: actually it was the sun behind  a quite thick gaze.To those who scored this picture with a "1": it would be nice to know the reasons why, I never get offended for a 1 :-)', '2004-01-21 04:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(551448, 55032, 6458, '<td valign="top">Chris: I can answer that one for Rob. Those cliffs are constantly collapsing - build the lighthouse on top of the cliff and eventually it will fall. Much safer to build it in the water ;)</td>', 'Chris: I can answer that one for Rob. Those cliffs are constantly collapsing - build the lighthouse on top of the cliff and eventually it will fall. Much safer to build it in the water ;)', '2004-01-21 05:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
