(551458, 54808, 15260, '<td valign="top">Hi, thanks for all your comments. You''ve all been very helpful, especially with your different interpretations. The shot was taken in a park on a very windy day at sunset, when no one was around. I purposely tried to infuse a degree of mystery in the photo.</td>', 'Hi, thanks for all your comments. You''ve all been very helpful, especially with your different interpretations. The shot was taken in a park on a very windy day at sunset, when no one was around. I purposely tried to infuse a degree of mystery in the photo.', '2004-01-21 05:29:56.000000', NULL, 0),
