(551477, 54532, 3306, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon on your first try. Looking forward to seeing more of you pictures.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon on your first try. Looking forward to seeing more of you pictures.', '2004-01-21 05:59:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(551506, 54361, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wow, 56 commments. I didn''t think I would stir so much emotion with this one! Thanks for all the great comments. This was a fun picture to take. The Corn wasn''t very yellow after it was cooked so I had to soak it in yellow die over night to get it more interesting looking. The "Saliva" is sprayed on water. I had to bite into the corn before placing it into the dentoform in order to get realistic bite marks. The dentoform was mine from dental school. All the work you see is how we practiced and learned to do different procedures. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-21 06:25:44.</i></td>', 'Wow, 56 commments. I didn''t think I would stir so much emotion with this one! Thanks for all the great comments. This was a fun picture to take. The Corn wasn''t very yellow after it was cooked so I had to soak it in yellow die over night to get it more interesting looking. The "Saliva" is sprayed on water. I had to bite into the corn before placing it into the dentoform in order to get realistic bite marks. The dentoform was mine from dental school. All the work you see is how we practiced and learned to do different procedures. ', '2004-01-21 06:22:25.000000', '2004-01-21 06:25:44.000000', 0),
(551513, 55116, 2195, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this didn''t place higher, much much higher; it should have. Excellent shot! I gave you a 10.</td>', 'I can''t believe this didn''t place higher, much much higher; it should have. Excellent shot! I gave you a 10.', '2004-01-21 06:32:20.000000', NULL, 0),
