(551523, 54532, 3540, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  I have mixed feelings about the new guys getting ribbons.  On the one hand its good to see new people winning.  On the other hand, there were already enough good people to compete with before you guys got here.  Just kidding.  Good find and good shot.</td>', 'Congrats!  I have mixed feelings about the new guys getting ribbons.  On the one hand its good to see new people winning.  On the other hand, there were already enough good people to compete with before you guys got here.  Just kidding.  Good find and good shot.', '2004-01-21 06:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(551534, 54664, 2195, '<td valign="top">Man, this should have placed much higher. And looking at it again now, I wonder if it would help it out by cropping down from the top of the shopper''s heads, cuting out the bright spots. But as I''ve learned myself, don''t let your score dictate to you the worth of your shot, as its been said in the forums, its simply because it doesn''t have mass appeal.</td>', 'Man, this should have placed much higher. And looking at it again now, I wonder if it would help it out by cropping down from the top of the shopper''s heads, cuting out the bright spots. But as I''ve learned myself, don''t let your score dictate to you the worth of your shot, as its been said in the forums, its simply because it doesn''t have mass appeal.', '2004-01-21 06:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(551541, 54675, 11738, '<td valign="top">Way under-rated.  You should have been top-20.  The cat and dog haters were out on this one.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Way under-rated.  You should have been top-20.  The cat and dog haters were out on this one.  Keep up the good work.', '2004-01-21 07:01:40.000000', NULL, 0),
