(551651, 54632, 14614, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and encouragement.  I had some fun conceiving and taking this shot.  To settle some open questions...the red rose was added because the shot needed some color and another element - a rose was more romantic than my old fuzzy slipper.  <br/> <br/>The husband did come home.  <br/> <br/>As for the ugly feet, my fault entirely.  I refused to let the model get a pedicure.  If you give into all their "diva" tendencies you''ve lost the battle!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and encouragement.  I had some fun conceiving and taking this shot.  To settle some open questions...the red rose was added because the shot needed some color and another element - a rose was more romantic than my old fuzzy slipper.   The husband did come home.   As for the ugly feet, my fault entirely.  I refused to let the model get a pedicure.  If you give into all their "diva" tendencies you''ve lost the battle!', '2004-01-21 08:14:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(551654, 54509, 15746, '<td valign="top">My vote was a 10. Great shot!</td>', 'My vote was a 10. Great shot!', '2004-01-21 08:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(551656, 54974, 14700, '<td valign="top">Don''t listen to them! Its a great shot, I like how you put the focus on the mirrors, its a great point of view, it was challenging (due to the mirrors), and the way you cropped it is fantastic.  <br/> <br/>I think most of the people who commented were ignorent.  <br/> <br/>You can tell by the number of comments you got, that you were able to provok the response you were looking for.  <br/> <br/>PROVOKING AN INTENDED RESPONSE IN A PHOTO TAKES TALENT TOO PEOPLE!</td>', 'Don''t listen to them! Its a great shot, I like how you put the focus on the mirrors, its a great point of view, it was challenging (due to the mirrors), and the way you cropped it is fantastic.   I think most of the people who commented were ignorent.   You can tell by the number of comments you got, that you were able to provok the response you were looking for.   PROVOKING AN INTENDED RESPONSE IN A PHOTO TAKES TALENT TOO PEOPLE!', '2004-01-21 08:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(551663, 54509, 14614, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a great shot - placed lower than it should in my opinion.  The head-pop makes it.</td>', 'I thought this was a great shot - placed lower than it should in my opinion.  The head-pop makes it.', '2004-01-21 08:26:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(551665, 54636, 14614, '<td valign="top">Jon,  Congrats on a great shot - too bad the scores don''t reflect it.</td>', 'Jon,  Congrats on a great shot - too bad the scores don''t reflect it.', '2004-01-21 08:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(551666, 55037, 772, '<td valign="top">Ben, this is an excellent shot.  I love the form and function theme and this one is no exception... great photo :)</td>', 'Ben, this is an excellent shot.  I love the form and function theme and this one is no exception... great photo :)', '2004-01-21 08:32:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(551669, 54661, 13043, '<td valign="top">I think my score was hurt by the figure in the background not being bright enough, since I''m sure there are a lot of people with uncalibrated monitors out there. Overall I''m happy with how it turned out in the challenge ie: its my first shot... hahaa<br/> <br/>Also no filter was used to get the star effect, it just happened.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-21 08:36:42.</i></td>', 'I think my score was hurt by the figure in the background not being bright enough, since I''m sure there are a lot of people with uncalibrated monitors out there. Overall I''m happy with how it turned out in the challenge ie: its my first shot... hahaa Also no filter was used to get the star effect, it just happened.', '2004-01-21 08:36:15.000000', '2004-01-21 08:36:42.000000', 0),
(551671, 54632, 6532, '<td valign="top">Wow - I am truly disappointed for you.  I though this was one of the top 3 for sure!  Fortunately, it did make the ranking as your top - so far!  I love the colors, the POV and framing.  I think you would do well to consider making it available on DPCprints.  Keep on snapping!</td>', 'Wow - I am truly disappointed for you.  I though this was one of the top 3 for sure!  Fortunately, it did make the ranking as your top - so far!  I love the colors, the POV and framing.  I think you would do well to consider making it available on DPCprints.  Keep on snapping!', '2004-01-21 08:36:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(551753, 54841, 15751, '<td valign="top">I think this is kind of neat! Sort of the same point of view that I was going for with my photo for this contest.  I guess the voters didnt really like it all that much...sorry, for both of us!<br/>-EP</td>', 'I think this is kind of neat! Sort of the same point of view that I was going for with my photo for this contest.  I guess the voters didnt really like it all that much...sorry, for both of us!-EP', '2004-01-21 09:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(551768, 54381, 4007, '<td valign="top">My favorite shot in the challenge as well.  Not that this is a bad finish, but I''d expected this to be higher.  Too bad.</td>', 'My favorite shot in the challenge as well.  Not that this is a bad finish, but I''d expected this to be higher.  Too bad.', '2004-01-21 09:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
