(552788, 54670, 10818, '<td valign="top">I thought this would do better.  I gave it a 9.  Maybe a bit to much of an extreme angle, not sure.  But a great photo.</td>', 'I thought this would do better.  I gave it a 9.  Maybe a bit to much of an extreme angle, not sure.  But a great photo.', '2004-01-21 20:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
