(584792, 54368, 15832, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by geschlechtmann27:</b></div><hr/><i> This photo is great! The texture of this photo is magnificent. The front cliff jumps out at you! The back mountain/hill and house seem very unreal. <br/> <br/>Towards the back of the photo it begins to get very blurry. This may be a contributing factor in the unreal-ness! I really enjoy the contrasting greens and blacks. Overall good photo.<br/> <br/>geschlechtmann27 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-09 05:48:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by geschlechtmann27: This photo is great! The texture of this photo is magnificent. The front cliff jumps out at you! The back mountain/hill and house seem very unreal.  Towards the back of the photo it begins to get very blurry. This may be a contributing factor in the unreal-ness! I really enjoy the contrasting greens and blacks. Overall good photo. geschlechtmann27   Thanks', '2004-02-18 06:42:28.000000', '2004-07-09 06:48:59.000000', 0),
