(1027939, 54205, 28771, '<td valign="top">Why are there two people just standing over the body with their backs turned? That to me makes it look staged, even if it isn''t. It''s still a good picture, and a great idea.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-22 20:18:03.</i></td>', 'Why are there two people just standing over the body with their backs turned? That to me makes it look staged, even if it isn''t. It''s still a good picture, and a great idea.', '2004-11-22 20:15:52.000000', '2004-11-22 20:18:03.000000', 0),
(1034853, 54958, 29132, '<td valign="top">I respectfully disagree with some of my fellow DPC members about the positioning of your arm in this self-portrait. This merely establishes the fact that we are watching from the photographer''s point of view. I also think the empty tiles to the right work just fine since this is the invisible part of the body that''s left to the imagination. The red shower curtain in the mirror to the left is a nice touch. This is a fun, sexy and interesting photo that deserves better than the average score it got in the competition.</td>', 'I respectfully disagree with some of my fellow DPC members about the positioning of your arm in this self-portrait. This merely establishes the fact that we are watching from the photographer''s point of view. I also think the empty tiles to the right work just fine since this is the invisible part of the body that''s left to the imagination. The red shower curtain in the mirror to the left is a nice touch. This is a fun, sexy and interesting photo that deserves better than the average score it got in the competition.', '2004-11-28 07:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1057679, 54335, 6900, '<td valign="top">This image is of something very fantastic.  I love the subject.  The crop and composition don''t appeal to my eye.  The topic and meaning are very nice, but maybe if you had something in the background (a different side, different angle?) it would have given some context.<br/> <br/>That all being said, I definitely like what I''m looking at in this.  The little stubble of trees in the LLC is funny.<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'This image is of something very fantastic.  I love the subject.  The crop and composition don''t appeal to my eye.  The topic and meaning are very nice, but maybe if you had something in the background (a different side, different angle?) it would have given some context. That all being said, I definitely like what I''m looking at in this.  The little stubble of trees in the LLC is funny. M', '2004-12-11 20:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
