(2936249, 55115, 19672, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like, but I almost think I would have preferred it to have the infant sketch be more of the background and your daughter more the foreground.<br/> <br/>I found composing the shot so the camera wasn''t in took a bit of work myself. Otherwise, quite a nice photo and I will add that you have quite the attractive daughter. <br/> <br/>I''d try to re-shoot this. And take note to try to have your daughter''s expression in a similar expression as the infant sketch.<br/> <br/>;)</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like, but I almost think I would have preferred it to have the infant sketch be more of the background and your daughter more the foreground. I found composing the shot so the camera wasn''t in took a bit of work myself. Otherwise, quite a nice photo and I will add that you have quite the attractive daughter.  I''d try to re-shoot this. And take note to try to have your daughter''s expression in a similar expression as the infant sketch. ;)', '2006-10-17 11:39:36.000000', NULL, 0),
