(3555860, 54333, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the deep contrasts here. I think turning the photo blue was a good choice - it''s a cold color, and reinforces the fact that it''s winter; as seen by the snow on the branch. The only thing I don''t really like is the grain. Otherwise; lovely shot!</td>', 'I love the deep contrasts here. I think turning the photo blue was a good choice - it''s a cold color, and reinforces the fact that it''s winter; as seen by the snow on the branch. The only thing I don''t really like is the grain. Otherwise; lovely shot!', '2007-04-17 17:57:28.000000', NULL, 0),
